\p \v 44 \rb These|אֵ֣לֶּה\rb* \rb were the men|אֲשֶׁר֩\rb* \rb numbered|פָּקַ֨ד\rb* \rb by Moses|מֹשֶׁ֤ה\rb* \rb and Aaron,|וְאַהֲרֹן֙\rb*\rb |הַפְּקֻדִ֡ים\rb* \rb with the assistance of the twelve|שְׁנֵ֥ים\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֖ר\rb*\rb |אִ֑ישׁ\rb*\rb |אִישׁ־\rb* \rb leaders|וּנְשִׂיאֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Israel,|יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb each one|אֶחָ֥ד\rb* \rb representing his family.|אֲבֹתָ֖יו\rb*\rb |הָיֽוּ׃\rb*\rb |לְבֵית־\rb* \v 45 \rb So all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְנֵֽי־\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֖ל\rb* \rb twenty|עֶשְׂרִ֤ים\rb* \rb years of age|מִבֶּ֨ן\rb*\rb |שָׁנָה֙\rb* \rb or older|וָמַ֔עְלָה\rb*\rb |כָּל־\rb* \rb who could serve|יֹצֵ֥א\rb* \rb in Israel’s|בְּיִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃\rb* \rb army|צָבָ֖א\rb* \rb were|וַיִּֽהְי֛וּ\rb* \rb counted|פְּקוּדֵ֥י\rb* \rb according to their families.|אֲבֹתָ֑ם\rb*\rb |לְבֵ֣ית\rb* \v 46 \rb And|וַיִּֽהְיוּ֙\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb those counted|הַפְּקֻדִ֔ים\rb* \rb totaled 603,550.|שֵׁשׁ־\rb*\rb |מֵא֥וֹת\rb*\rb |אֶ֖לֶף\rb*\rb |וּשְׁלֹ֣שֶׁת\rb*\rb |אֲלָפִ֑ים\rb*\rb |וַחֲמֵ֥שׁ\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |וַחֲמִשִּֽׁים׃\rb*
\s1 The Exemption of the Levites
\p \v 47 \rb The Levites, however,|וְהַלְוִיִּ֖ם\rb* \rb were not|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb numbered|הָתְפָּקְד֖וּ\rb* \rb along with them|בְּתוֹכָֽם׃פ\rb* \rb by the tribe|לְמַטֵּ֣ה\rb* \rb of their fathers.|אֲבֹתָ֑ם\rb* \v 48 \rb For the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb had said to|וַיְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb Moses:|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |לֵּאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 49 \rb |אַ֣ךְ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb “Do not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb number|תִפְקֹ֔ד\rb* \rb the tribe|מַטֵּ֤ה\rb* \rb of Levi|לֵוִי֙\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb in the census|רֹאשָׁ֖ם\rb*\rb |לֹ֣א\rb*\rb |תִשָּׂ֑א\rb* \rb with|בְּת֖וֹךְ\rb* \rb the other Israelites.|בְּנֵ֥י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃\rb* \v 50 \rb Instead,|וְאַתָּ֡ה\rb* \rb you are to appoint|הַפְקֵ֣ד\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the Levites|הַלְוִיִּם֩\rb* \rb over|עַל־\rb* \rb the tabernacle|מִשְׁכַּ֨ן\rb* \rb of the Testimony,|הָעֵדֻ֜ת\rb*\rb |וְעַ֣ל\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb its furnishings,|כֵּלָיו֮\rb*\rb |וְעַ֣ל\rb* \rb and everything|כָּל־\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb in it.|לוֹ֒\rb* \rb They|הֵ֜מָּה\rb* \rb shall carry|יִשְׂא֤וּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the tabernacle|הַמִּשְׁכָּן֙\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb and all|כָּל־\rb* \rb its articles,|כֵּלָ֔יו\rb*\rb |וְהֵ֖ם\rb* \rb care for it,|יְשָׁרְתֻ֑הוּ\rb* \rb and camp|יַחֲנֽוּ׃\rb* \rb around|וְסָבִ֥יב\rb* \rb it.|לַמִּשְׁכָּ֖ן\rb*
\p \v 51 \rb Whenever the tabernacle|הַמִּשְׁכָּ֗ן\rb* \rb is to move,|וּבִנְסֹ֣עַ\rb* \rb the Levites|הַלְוִיִּ֔ם\rb* \rb are to take it down,|יוֹרִ֤ידוּ\rb*\rb |אֹתוֹ֙\rb* \rb and whenever it|הַמִּשְׁכָּ֔ן\rb* \rb is to be pitched,|וּבַחֲנֹת֙\rb* \rb the Levites|הַלְוִיִּ֑ם\rb* \rb are to set it up.|יָקִ֥ימוּ\rb*\rb |אֹת֖וֹ\rb* \rb Any outsider|וְהַזָּ֥ר\rb* \rb who goes near it|הַקָּרֵ֖ב\rb* \rb must be put to death.|יוּמָֽת׃\rb*
\p \v 52 \rb The Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb* \rb are to camp|וְחָנ֖וּ\rb* \rb by their divisions,|לְצִבְאֹתָֽם׃\rb* \rb each man|אִ֧ישׁ\rb* \rb in|עַֽל־\rb* \rb his own camp|מַחֲנֵ֛הוּ\rb*\rb |וְאִ֥ישׁ\rb* \rb and under|עַל־\rb* \rb his own standard.|דִּגְל֖וֹ\rb* \v 53 \rb But the Levites|וְהַלְוִיִּ֞ם\rb* \rb are to camp|יַחֲנ֤וּ\rb* \rb around|סָבִיב֙\rb* \rb the tabernacle|לְמִשְׁכַּ֣ן\rb* \rb of the Testimony|הָעֵדֻ֔ת\rb* \rb and watch over it,|וְשָׁמְרוּ֙\rb* \rb so that no|וְלֹֽא־\rb* \rb wrath|קֶ֔צֶף\rb* \rb will fall|יִהְיֶ֣ה\rb* \rb on|עַל־\rb* \rb the congregation|עֲדַ֖ת\rb*\rb |בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Israel.|יִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb* \rb So the Levites|הַלְוִיִּ֔ם\rb* \rb are responsible|מִשְׁמֶ֖רֶת\rb* \rb for the tabernacle|מִשְׁכַּ֥ן\rb* \rb of the Testimony.”|הָעֵדֽוּת׃\rb*
\p \v 54 \rb Thus the Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb* \rb did|וַֽיַּעֲשׂ֖וּ\rb* \rb everything|כְּ֠כֹל\rb* \rb just as|אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֛ה\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb had commanded|צִוָּ֧ה\rb* \rb Moses.|מֹשֶׁ֖ה\rb*\rb |כֵּ֥ן\rb*\rb |עָשֽׂוּ׃פ\rb*
\c 2
\s1 The Order of the Camps
\p \v 1 \rb Then the LORD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb said|וַיְדַבֵּ֣ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |וְאֶֽל־\rb* \rb and Aaron:|אַהֲרֹ֖ן\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 2 \rb “The Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb* \rb are to camp|יַחֲנ֖וּ\rb* \rb around|סָבִ֥יב\rb* \rb the Tent|לְאֹֽהֶל־\rb* \rb of Meeting|מוֹעֵ֖ד\rb* \rb at a distance from it,|מִנֶּ֕גֶד\rb*\rb |יַחֲנֽוּ׃\rb* \rb each man|אִ֣ישׁ\rb* \rb under|עַל־\rb* \rb his standard,|דִּגְל֤וֹ\rb* \rb with the banners|בְאֹתֹת֙\rb* \rb of his family.|אֲבֹתָ֔ם\rb*\rb |לְבֵ֣ית\rb*
\p \v 3 \rb On the east side,|קֵ֣דְמָה\rb* \rb toward the sunrise,|מִזְרָ֔חָה\rb* \rb the divisions|לְצִבְאֹתָ֑ם\rb* \rb of Judah|יְהוּדָ֖ה\rb* \rb are to camp|וְהַחֹנִים֙\rb* \rb under their standard:|דֶּ֛גֶל\rb*\rb |מַחֲנֵ֥ה\rb*
\li1 \rb The leader|וְנָשִׂיא֙\rb*\rb |לִבְנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of the Judahites|יְהוּדָ֔ה\rb* \rb is Nahshon|נַחְשׁ֖וֹן\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Amminadab,|עַמִּינָדָֽב׃\rb* \v 4 \rb and his division|וּצְבָא֖וֹ\rb* \rb numbers|וּפְקֻדֵיהֶ֑ם\rb* \rb 74,600.|אַרְבָּעָ֧ה\rb*\rb |וְשִׁבְעִ֛ים\rb*\rb |אֶ֖לֶף\rb*\rb |וְשֵׁ֥שׁ\rb*\rb |מֵאֽוֹת׃\rb*
\li1 \v 5 \rb The tribe|מַטֵּ֣ה\rb* \rb of Issachar|יִשָּׂשכָ֑ר\rb* \rb will camp|וְהַחֹנִ֥ים\rb* \rb next to it.|עָלָ֖יו\rb* \rb The leader|וְנָשִׂיא֙\rb* \rb of the Issacharites|לִבְנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשָּׂשכָ֔ר\rb* \rb is Nethanel|נְתַנְאֵ֖ל\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Zuar,|צוּעָֽר׃\rb* \v 6 \rb and his division|וּצְבָא֖וֹ\rb* \rb numbers|וּפְקֻדָ֑יו\rb* \rb 54,400.|אַרְבָּעָ֧ה\rb*\rb |וַחֲמִשִּׁ֛ים\rb*\rb |אֶ֖לֶף\rb*\rb |וְאַרְבַּ֥ע\rb*\rb |מֵאֽוֹת׃ס\rb*
\li1 \v 7 \rb Next will be the tribe|מַטֵּ֖ה\rb* \rb of Zebulun.|זְבוּלֻ֑ן\rb* \rb The leader|וְנָשִׂיא֙\rb* \rb of the Zebulunites|לִבְנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |זְבוּלֻ֔ן\rb* \rb is Eliab|אֱלִיאָ֖ב\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Helon,|חֵלֹֽן׃\rb* \v 8 \rb and his division|וּצְבָא֖וֹ\rb* \rb numbers|וּפְקֻדָ֑יו\rb* \rb 57,400.|שִׁבְעָ֧ה\rb*\rb |וַחֲמִשִּׁ֛ים\rb*\rb |אֶ֖לֶף\rb*\rb |וְאַרְבַּ֥ע\rb*\rb |מֵאֽוֹת׃\rb*
