\p \v 21 \rb And the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb said|וַיְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |לֵּאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 22 \rb “Take a census|נָשֹׂ֗א\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb*\rb |רֹ֛אשׁ\rb* \rb of the Gershonites|בְּנֵ֥י\rb*\rb |גֵרְשׁ֖וֹן\rb* \rb as well,|גַּם־\rb*\rb |הֵ֑ם\rb* \rb by their families|אֲבֹתָ֖ם\rb*\rb |לְבֵ֥ית\rb* \rb and clans,|לְמִשְׁפְּחֹתָֽם׃\rb* \v 23 \rb from thirty|שְׁלֹשִׁ֨ים\rb*\rb |מִבֶּן֩\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֜ה\rb*\rb |וָמַ֗עְלָה\rb* \rb to|עַ֛ד\rb* \rb fifty|חֲמִשִּׁ֥ים\rb* \rb years old,|בֶּן־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֖ה\rb* \rb counting|תִּפְקֹ֣ד\rb*\rb |אוֹתָ֑ם\rb* \rb everyone|כָּל־\rb* \rb who comes|הַבָּא֙\rb* \rb to serve|לִצְבֹ֣א\rb* \rb in the work|עֲבֹדָ֖ה\rb* \rb at the Tent|בְּאֹ֥הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting.|מוֹעֵֽד׃\rb*
