\p \v 29 \rb As for the sons|בְּנֵ֖י\rb* \rb of Merari,|מְרָרִ֑י\rb* \rb you are to number|תִּפְקֹ֥ד\rb* \rb them|אֹתָֽם׃\rb* \rb by their clans|לְמִשְׁפְּחֹתָ֥ם\rb* \rb and families,|אֲבֹתָ֖ם\rb*\rb |לְבֵית־\rb* \v 30 \rb from thirty|שְׁלֹשִׁ֨ים\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֜ה\rb*\rb |מִבֶּן֩\rb*\rb |וָמַ֗עְלָה\rb* \rb to|וְעַ֛ד\rb* \rb fifty|חֲמִשִּׁ֥ים\rb* \rb years old,|בֶּן־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֖ה\rb* \rb counting|תִּפְקְדֵ֑ם\rb* \rb everyone|כָּל־\rb* \rb who comes|הַבָּא֙\rb* \rb to serve|לַצָּבָ֔א\rb*\rb |לַעֲבֹ֕ד\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb in the work|עֲבֹדַ֖ת\rb* \rb of the Tent|אֹ֥הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting.|מוֹעֵֽד׃\rb*
\p \v 31 \rb This|וְזֹאת֙\rb* \rb is the duty|מִשְׁמֶ֣רֶת\rb* \rb for all|לְכָל־\rb* \rb their service|עֲבֹדָתָ֖ם\rb* \rb at the Tent|בְּאֹ֣הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting:|מוֹעֵ֑ד\rb* \rb to carry|מַשָּׂאָ֔ם\rb* \rb the frames|קַרְשֵׁי֙\rb* \rb of the tabernacle|הַמִּשְׁכָּ֔ן\rb* \rb with its crossbars,|וּבְרִיחָ֖יו\rb* \rb posts,|וְעַמּוּדָ֥יו\rb* \rb and bases,|וַאֲדָנָֽיו׃\rb* \v 32 \rb and the posts|וְעַמּוּדֵי֩\rb* \rb of the surrounding|סָבִ֜יב\rb* \rb courtyard|הֶחָצֵ֨ר\rb* \rb with their bases,|וְאַדְנֵיהֶ֗ם\rb* \rb tent pegs,|וִֽיתֵדֹתָם֙\rb* \rb and ropes,|וּמֵ֣יתְרֵיהֶ֔ם\rb* \rb including all|לְכָל־\rb* \rb their equipment|כְּלֵיהֶ֔ם\rb* \rb and everything|וּלְכֹ֖ל\rb* \rb related to their use.|עֲבֹדָתָ֑ם\rb* \rb You shall assign|תִּפְקְד֔וּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb by name|וּבְשֵׁמֹ֣ת\rb* \rb the items|כְּלֵ֖י\rb* \rb that they are responsible|מִשְׁמֶ֥רֶת\rb* \rb to carry.|מַשָּׂאָֽם׃\rb*
\p \v 33 \rb This|זֹ֣את\rb* \rb is the service|עֲבֹדַ֗ת\rb* \rb of the Merarite|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |מְרָרִ֔י\rb* \rb clans|מִשְׁפְּחֹת֙\rb* \rb according to all|לְכָל־\rb* \rb their work|עֲבֹדָתָ֖ם\rb* \rb at the Tent|בְּאֹ֣הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting,|מוֹעֵ֑ד\rb* \rb under the direction|בְּיַד֙\rb* \rb of Ithamar|אִֽיתָמָ֔ר\rb* \rb son|בֶּֽן־\rb* \rb of Aaron|אַהֲרֹ֖ן\rb* \rb the priest.”|הַכֹּהֵֽן׃\rb*
\s1 The Numbering of the Levite Clans
\p \v 34 \rb So Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֧ה\rb* \rb Aaron,|וְאַהֲרֹ֛ן\rb* \rb and the leaders|וּנְשִׂיאֵ֥י\rb* \rb of the congregation|הָעֵדָ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb numbered|וַיִּפְקֹ֨ד\rb* \rb the Kohathites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |הַקְּהָתִ֑י\rb* \rb by their clans|לְמִשְׁפְּחֹתָ֖ם\rb* \rb and families,|אֲבֹתָֽם׃\rb*\rb |וּלְבֵ֥ית\rb* \v 35 \rb everyone|כָּל־\rb* \rb from thirty|שְׁלֹשִׁ֤ים\rb*\rb |שָׁנָה֙\rb*\rb |מִבֶּ֨ן\rb*\rb |וָמַ֔עְלָה\rb* \rb to|וְעַ֖ד\rb* \rb fifty|חֲמִשִּׁ֣ים\rb* \rb years old|בֶּן־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֑ה\rb* \rb who came|הַבָּא֙\rb* \rb to serve|לַצָּבָ֔א\rb* \rb in the work|לַעֲבֹדָ֖ה\rb* \rb at the Tent|בְּאֹ֥הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting.|מוֹעֵֽד׃\rb* \v 36 \rb And those|וַיִּהְי֥וּ\rb* \rb numbered|פְקֻדֵיהֶ֖ם\rb* \rb by their clans|לְמִשְׁפְּחֹתָ֑ם\rb* \rb totaled 2,750.|אַלְפַּ֕יִם\rb*\rb |שְׁבַ֥ע\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |וַחֲמִשִּֽׁים׃\rb* \v 37 \rb These|אֵ֤לֶּה\rb* \rb were counted|פְקוּדֵי֙\rb* \rb from the Kohathite|הַקְּהָתִ֔י\rb* \rb clans,|מִשְׁפְּחֹ֣ת\rb* \rb everyone|כָּל־\rb* \rb who could serve|הָעֹבֵ֖ד\rb* \rb at the Tent|בְּאֹ֣הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting.|מוֹעֵ֑ד\rb* \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁה֙\rb* \rb and Aaron|וְאַהֲרֹ֔ן\rb* \rb numbered|פָּקַ֤ד\rb* \rb them|אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb according to|עַל־\rb* \rb the command|פִּ֥י\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb through|בְּיַד־\rb* \rb Moses.|מֹשֶֽׁה׃ס\rb*
\p \v 38 \rb Then the Gershonites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |גֵרְשׁ֑וֹן\rb* \rb were numbered|וּפְקוּדֵ֖י\rb* \rb by their clans|לְמִשְׁפְּחוֹתָ֖ם\rb* \rb and families,|אֲבֹתָֽם׃\rb*\rb |וּלְבֵ֥ית\rb* \v 39 \rb everyone|כָּל־\rb* \rb from thirty|שְׁלֹשִׁ֤ים\rb*\rb |מִבֶּ֨ן\rb*\rb |שָׁנָה֙\rb*\rb |וָמַ֔עְלָה\rb* \rb to|וְעַ֖ד\rb* \rb fifty|חֲמִשִּׁ֣ים\rb* \rb years old|בֶּן־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֑ה\rb* \rb who came|הַבָּא֙\rb* \rb to serve|לַצָּבָ֔א\rb* \rb in the work|לַעֲבֹדָ֖ה\rb* \rb at the Tent|בְּאֹ֥הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting.|מוֹעֵֽד׃\rb* \v 40 \rb And those|וַיִּֽהְיוּ֙\rb* \rb numbered|פְּקֻ֣דֵיהֶ֔ם\rb* \rb by their clans|לְמִשְׁפְּחֹתָ֖ם\rb* \rb and families|אֲבֹתָ֑ם\rb*\rb |לְבֵ֣ית\rb* \rb totaled 2,630.|אַלְפַּ֕יִם\rb*\rb |וְשֵׁ֥שׁ\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |וּשְׁלֹשִֽׁים׃\rb* \v 41 \rb These|אֵ֣לֶּה\rb* \rb were counted|פְקוּדֵ֗י\rb*\rb |בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb from the Gershonite|גֵרְשׁ֔וֹן\rb* \rb clans|מִשְׁפְּחֹת֙\rb*\rb |כָּל־\rb* \rb who served|הָעֹבֵ֖ד\rb* \rb at the Tent|בְּאֹ֣הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting,|מוֹעֵ֑ד\rb* \rb whom|אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁ֛ה\rb* \rb and Aaron|וְאַהֲרֹ֖ן\rb* \rb counted|פָּקַ֥ד\rb* \rb at|עַל־\rb* \rb the LORD’s|יְהוָֽה׃\rb* \rb command.|פִּ֥י\rb*
\p \v 42 \rb |בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb And the Merarites|מְרָרִ֑י\rb*\rb |מִשְׁפְּחֹ֖ת\rb* \rb were numbered|וּפְקוּדֵ֕י\rb* \rb by their clans|לְמִשְׁפְּחֹתָ֖ם\rb* \rb and families,|אֲבֹתָֽם׃\rb*\rb |לְבֵ֥ית\rb* \v 43 \rb everyone|כָּל־\rb* \rb from thirty|שְׁלֹשִׁ֤ים\rb*\rb |מִבֶּ֨ן\rb*\rb |שָׁנָה֙\rb*\rb |וָמַ֔עְלָה\rb* \rb to|וְעַ֖ד\rb* \rb fifty|חֲמִשִּׁ֣ים\rb* \rb years old|בֶּן־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֑ה\rb* \rb who came|הַבָּא֙\rb* \rb to serve|לַצָּבָ֔א\rb* \rb in the work|לַעֲבֹדָ֖ה\rb* \rb at the Tent|בְּאֹ֥הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting.|מוֹעֵֽד׃\rb* \v 44 \rb |וַיִּהְי֥וּ\rb* \rb The men registered|פְקֻדֵיהֶ֖ם\rb* \rb by their clans|לְמִשְׁפְּחֹתָ֑ם\rb* \rb numbered 3,200.|שְׁלֹ֥שֶׁת\rb*\rb |אֲלָפִ֖ים\rb*\rb |וּמָאתָֽיִם׃\rb* \v 45 \rb These|אֵ֣לֶּה\rb* \rb were counted|פְקוּדֵ֔י\rb* \rb from the Merarite|מְרָרִ֑י\rb* \rb clans,|מִשְׁפְּחֹ֖ת\rb*\rb |בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb whom|אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁה֙\rb* \rb and Aaron|וְאַהֲרֹ֔ן\rb* \rb numbered|פָּקַ֤ד\rb* \rb at|עַל־\rb* \rb the LORD’s|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb command|פִּ֥י\rb* \rb through|בְּיַד־\rb* \rb Moses.|מֹשֶֽׁה׃\rb*
\p \v 46 \rb So Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֧ה\rb* \rb Aaron,|וְאַהֲרֹ֛ן\rb* \rb and the leaders|וּנְשִׂיאֵ֥י\rb* \rb of Israel|יִשְׂרָאֵ֖ל\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb numbered|הַפְּקֻדִ֡ים\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁר֩\rb*\rb |פָּקַ֨ד\rb* \rb by their clans|לְמִשְׁפְּחֹתָ֖ם\rb* \rb and families|אֲבֹתָֽם׃\rb*\rb |וּלְבֵ֥ית\rb* \rb all|כָּֽל־\rb* \rb the Levites|הַלְוִיִּ֑ם\rb* \v 47 \rb from thirty|שְׁלֹשִׁ֤ים\rb*\rb |מִבֶּ֨ן\rb*\rb |שָׁנָה֙\rb*\rb |וָמַ֔עְלָה\rb* \rb to|וְעַ֖ד\rb* \rb fifty|חֲמִשִּׁ֣ים\rb* \rb years old|בֶּן־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֑ה\rb*\rb |כָּל־\rb* \rb who came|הַבָּ֗א\rb* \rb to do|לַעֲבֹ֨ד\rb* \rb the work|עֲבֹדַ֧ת\rb* \rb of serving|עֲבֹדָ֛ה\rb*\rb |וַעֲבֹדַ֥ת\rb* \rb and carrying|מַשָּׂ֖א\rb* \rb the Tent|בְּאֹ֥הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting.|מוֹעֵֽד׃\rb* \v 48 \rb And|וַיִּהְי֖וּ\rb* \rb the number of men|פְּקֻדֵיהֶ֑ם\rb* \rb was 8,580.|שְׁמֹנַ֣ת\rb*\rb |אֲלָפִ֔ים\rb*\rb |וַחֲמֵ֥שׁ\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |וּשְׁמֹנִֽים׃\rb* \v 49 \rb At|עַל־\rb* \rb the LORD’s|יְהוָ֜ה\rb* \rb command|פִּ֨י\rb*\rb |אוֹתָם֙\rb* \rb through|בְּיַד־\rb* \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁ֔ה\rb* \rb they were numbered,|פָּקַ֤ד\rb* \rb and each one|אִ֥ישׁ\rb*\rb |אִ֛ישׁ\rb* \rb was assigned|וּפְקֻדָ֕יו\rb*\rb |עַל־\rb* \rb his work|עֲבֹדָת֖וֹ\rb*\rb |וְעַל־\rb* \rb and burden,|מַשָּׂא֑וֹ\rb* \rb as|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb had commanded|צִוָּ֥ה\rb* \rb Moses.|מֹשֶֽׁה׃פ\rb*
\c 5
\s1 Cleansing the Camps
\r \ref Leviticus 13:1–46|LEV 13:1-46\ref*)
\p \v 1 \rb Then the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb said|וַיְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |לֵּאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 2 \rb “Command|צַ֚ו\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb to send away|וִֽישַׁלְּחוּ֙\rb* \rb from|מִן־\rb* \rb the camp|הַֽמַּחֲנֶ֔ה\rb* \rb anyone|כָּל־\rb* \rb with a skin disease,|צָר֖וּעַ\rb*\f + \fr 5:2 \ft Forms of the Hebrew \fqa tzaraath\ft , traditionally translated as \fqa leprosy\ft , were used for various skin diseases; see Leviticus 13.\f* \rb anyone|וְכָל־\rb* \rb who has a bodily discharge,|זָ֑ב\rb* \rb and anyone|וְכֹ֖ל\rb* \rb who is defiled|טָמֵ֥א\rb* \rb by a dead body.|לָנָֽפֶשׁ׃\rb* \v 3 \rb You must send away|תְּשַׁלֵּ֔חוּ\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb male|מִזָּכָ֤ר\rb* \rb and|עַד־\rb* \rb female alike;|נְקֵבָה֙\rb* \rb send them|תְּשַׁלְּח֑וּם\rb* \rb outside|מִח֥וּץ\rb* \rb the camp|לַֽמַּחֲנֶ֖ה\rb* \rb so they will not|וְלֹ֤א\rb* \rb defile|יְטַמְּאוּ֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb their camp,|מַ֣חֲנֵיהֶ֔ם\rb* \rb where|אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb I|אֲנִ֖י\rb* \rb dwell|שֹׁכֵ֥ן\rb* \rb among them.”|בְּתוֹכָֽם׃\rb*
\p \v 4 \rb So the Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb did|וַיַּֽעֲשׂוּ־\rb* \rb this,|כֵן֙\rb* \rb sending|וַיְשַׁלְּח֣וּ\rb* \rb such people|אוֹתָ֔ם\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb outside|מִח֖וּץ\rb* \rb the camp.|לַֽמַּחֲנֶ֑ה\rb* \rb They|בְּנֵ֥י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃פ\rb* \rb did|עָשׂ֖וּ\rb* \rb just as|כַּאֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָה֙\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb had instructed|דִּבֶּ֤ר\rb* \rb Moses.|מֹשֶׁ֔ה\rb*\rb |כֵּ֥ן\rb*
\s1 Confession and Restitution
\r \ref Luke 19:1–10|LUK 19:1-10\ref*)
\p \v 5 \rb And the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb said|וַיְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |לֵּאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 6 \rb “Tell|דַּבֵּר֮\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb the Israelites that|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵל֒\rb* \rb when|כִּ֤י\rb* \rb a man|אִ֣ישׁ\rb* \rb or|אֽוֹ־\rb* \rb woman|אִשָּׁ֗ה\rb* \rb acts|לִמְעֹ֥ל\rb* \rb unfaithfully|מַ֖עַל\rb* \rb against the LORD|בַּיהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb by committing|יַעֲשׂוּ֙\rb* \rb any|מִכָּל־\rb* \rb sin|חַטֹּ֣את\rb* \rb against another,|הָֽאָדָ֔ם\rb* \rb that|הַהִֽוא׃\rb* \rb person|הַנֶּ֥פֶשׁ\rb* \rb is guilty|וְאָֽשְׁמָ֖ה\rb* \v 7 \rb and must confess|וְהִתְוַדּ֗וּ\rb*\rb |אֶֽת־\rb* \rb the sin|חַטָּאתָם֮\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb he has committed.|עָשׂוּ֒\rb* \rb He must make full restitution,|וְהֵשִׁ֤יב\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb*\rb |אֲשָׁמוֹ֙\rb*\rb |בְּרֹאשׁ֔וֹ\rb* \rb add|יֹסֵ֣ף\rb* \rb a fifth|וַחֲמִישִׁת֖וֹ\rb* \rb to its value,|עָלָ֑יו\rb* \rb and give all this|וְנָתַ֕ן\rb* \rb to the one|לַאֲשֶׁ֖ר\rb* \rb he has wronged.|אָשַׁ֥ם\rb*
\p \v 8 \rb But if|וְאִם־\rb* \rb the man|לָאִ֜ישׁ\rb* \rb has no|אֵ֨ין\rb* \rb relative|גֹּאֵ֗ל\rb* \rb to whom restitution can be made for|לְהָשִׁ֤יב\rb* \rb the wrong,|הָאָשָׁם֙\rb*\rb |אֵלָ֔יו\rb*\rb |הָאָשָׁ֛ם\rb* \rb the restitution|הַמּוּשָׁ֥ב\rb* \rb belongs to the LORD|לַיהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb and must be given to the priest|לַכֹּהֵ֑ן\rb* \rb along with|מִלְּבַ֗ד\rb* \rb the ram|אֵ֚יל\rb* \rb of atonement,|הַכִּפֻּרִ֔ים\rb* \rb by which|אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb the atonement is made|יְכַפֶּר־\rb* \rb for|בּ֖וֹ\rb* \rb him.|עָלָֽיו׃\rb*
\p \v 9 \rb Every|וְכָל־\rb* \rb sacred|קָדְשֵׁ֧י\rb* \rb contribution|תְּרוּמָ֞ה\rb*\rb |לְכָל־\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְנֵי־\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֛ל\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb bring|יַקְרִ֥יבוּ\rb* \rb to the priest|לַכֹּהֵ֖ן\rb* \rb shall belong|יִהְיֶֽה׃\rb* \rb to him.|ל֥וֹ\rb* \v 10 \rb Each man’s|וְאִ֥ישׁ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb sacred gifts|קֳדָשָׁ֖יו\rb* \rb are his own,|ל֣וֹ\rb*\rb |יִהְי֑וּ\rb* \rb but whatever|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb he|אִ֛ישׁ\rb* \rb gives|יִתֵּ֥ן\rb* \rb to the priest|לַכֹּהֵ֖ן\rb* \rb will belong to|יִהְיֶֽה׃פ\rb* \rb the priest.”|ל֥וֹ\rb*
\s1 The Adultery Test
\p \v 11 \rb Then the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb said|וַיְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |לֵּאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 12 \rb “Speak|דַּבֵּר֙\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb and tell them that|וְאָמַרְתָּ֖\rb*\rb |אֲלֵהֶ֑ם\rb* \rb if|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb any man’s|אִ֥ישׁ\rb*\rb |אִישׁ֙\rb* \rb wife|אִשְׁתּ֔וֹ\rb* \rb goes astray|תִשְׂטֶ֣ה\rb* \rb and is unfaithful|וּמָעֲלָ֥ה\rb* \rb to him|ב֖וֹ\rb* \v 13 \rb by sleeping with|וְשָׁכַ֨ב\rb* \rb another man,|אִ֣ישׁ\rb*\rb |אֹתָהּ֮\rb*\rb |שִׁכְבַת־\rb*\rb |זֶרַע֒\rb* \rb and it is concealed|וְנֶעְלַם֙\rb* \rb from|מֵעֵינֵ֣י\rb* \rb her husband|אִישָׁ֔הּ\rb* \rb and her|וְהִ֣יא\rb* \rb impurity|נִטְמָ֑אָה\rb* \rb is undetected|וְנִסְתְּרָ֖ה\rb* \rb (since there is no|אֵ֣ין\rb* \rb witness against her|וְעֵד֙\rb*\rb |בָּ֔הּ\rb* \rb and she|וְהִ֖וא\rb* \rb was not|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb caught in the act),|נִתְפָּֽשָׂה׃\rb* \v 14 \rb and if a feeling|רֽוּחַ־\rb* \rb of jealousy|קִנְאָ֛ה\rb* \rb comes over|וְעָבַ֨ר\rb* \rb her husband|עָלָ֧יו\rb* \rb and he suspects|וְקִנֵּ֥א\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb his wife|אִשְׁתּ֖וֹ\rb* \rb who|וְהִ֣וא\rb* \rb has defiled herself—|נִטְמָ֑אָה\rb* \rb or|אוֹ־\rb* \rb if a feeling|רֽוּחַ־\rb* \rb of jealousy|קִנְאָה֙\rb* \rb comes over|עָבַ֨ר\rb* \rb him|עָלָ֤יו\rb* \rb and he suspects|וְקִנֵּ֣א\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb her|אִשְׁתּ֔וֹ\rb* \rb even though she|וְהִ֖יא\rb* \rb has not|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb defiled herself—|נִטְמָֽאָה׃\rb* \v 15 \rb then he|הָאִ֣ישׁ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb is to bring|וְהֵבִ֨יא\rb* \rb his wife|אִשְׁתּוֹ֮\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the priest.|הַכֹּהֵן֒\rb*
