\q1 \v 8 \rb I speak|אֲדַבֶּר־\rb* \rb with him|בּ֗וֹ\rb* \rb face|פֶּ֣ה\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb face,|פֶּ֞ה\rb*
\q2 \rb clearly|וּמַרְאֶה֙\rb* \rb and not|וְלֹ֣א\rb* \rb in riddles;|בְחִידֹ֔ת\rb*
