\p \v 3 \rb So at|עַל־\rb* \rb the command|פִּ֣י\rb*\f + \fr 13:3 \ft Literally \fqa according to the mouth\f* \rb of the LORD,|יְהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁ֛ה\rb* \rb sent them|וַיִּשְׁלַ֨ח\rb* \rb out|אֹתָ֥ם\rb* \rb from the Wilderness|מִמִּדְבַּ֥ר\rb* \rb of Paran.|פָּארָ֖ן\rb* \rb All|כֻּלָּ֣ם\rb* \rb the men|אֲנָשִׁ֔ים\rb* \rb were leaders|רָאשֵׁ֥י\rb*\rb |בְנֵֽי־\rb* \rb of the Israelites,|יִשְׂרָאֵ֖ל\rb*\rb |הֵֽמָּה׃\rb* \v 4 \rb and these|וְאֵ֖לֶּה\rb* \rb were their names:|שְׁמוֹתָ֑ם\rb*
