\p \v 27 \rb And they gave this account|וַיְסַפְּרוּ־\rb* \rb to Moses:|לוֹ֙\rb*\rb |וַיֹּ֣אמְר֔וּ\rb* \rb “We went|בָּ֕אנוּ\rb* \rb into|אֶל־\rb* \rb the land|הָאָ֖רֶץ\rb* \rb to which|אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb you sent us,|שְׁלַחְתָּ֑נוּ\rb* \rb and indeed,|וְ֠גַם\rb* \rb it|הִ֖וא\rb* \rb is flowing|זָבַ֨ת\rb* \rb with milk|חָלָ֥ב\rb* \rb and honey.|וּדְבַ֛שׁ\rb* \rb Here is|וְזֶה־\rb* \rb some of its fruit!|פִּרְיָֽהּ׃\rb* \v 28 \rb Nevertheless,|אֶ֚פֶס\rb*\rb |כִּֽי־\rb* \rb the people|הָעָ֔ם\rb* \rb living|הַיֹּשֵׁ֖ב\rb* \rb in the land|בָּאָ֑רֶץ\rb* \rb are strong,|עַ֣ז\rb* \rb and the cities|וְהֶֽעָרִ֗ים\rb*\rb |בְּצֻר֤וֹת\rb* \rb are large|גְּדֹלֹת֙\rb* \rb and fortified.|מְאֹ֔ד\rb* \rb We even|וְגַם־\rb* \rb saw|רָאִ֥ינוּ\rb* \rb the descendants|יְלִדֵ֥י\rb* \rb of Anak|הָֽעֲנָ֖ק\rb* \rb there.|שָֽׁם׃\rb* \v 29 \rb The Amalekites|עֲמָלֵ֥ק\rb* \rb live|יוֹשֵׁ֖ב\rb* \rb in the land|בְּאֶ֣רֶץ\rb* \rb of the Negev;|הַנֶּ֑גֶב\rb* \rb the Hittites,|וְ֠הַֽחִתִּי\rb* \rb Jebusites,|וְהַיְבוּסִ֤י\rb* \rb and Amorites|וְהָֽאֱמֹרִי֙\rb* \rb live|יוֹשֵׁ֣ב\rb* \rb in the hill country;|בָּהָ֔ר\rb* \rb and the Canaanites|וְהַֽכְּנַעֲנִי֙\rb* \rb live|יֹשֵׁ֣ב\rb* \rb by|עַל־\rb* \rb the sea|הַיָּ֔ם\rb* \rb and along|וְעַ֖ל\rb*\rb |יַ֥ד\rb* \rb the Jordan.”|הַיַּרְדֵּֽן׃\rb*
\p \v 30 \rb Then Caleb|כָּלֵ֛ב\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb quieted|וַיַּ֧הַס\rb* \rb the people|הָעָ֖ם\rb* \rb before|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁ֑ה\rb* \rb and said,|וַיֹּ֗אמֶר\rb* \rb “We must go up|עָלֹ֤ה\rb*\rb |נַעֲלֶה֙\rb* \rb and take possession of|וְיָרַ֣שְׁנוּ\rb* \rb the land,|אֹתָ֔הּ\rb* \rb for|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb we can certainly conquer|יָכ֥וֹל\rb*\rb |נוּכַ֖ל\rb* \rb it!”|לָֽהּ׃\rb*
\p \v 31 \rb But the men|וְהָ֨אֲנָשִׁ֜ים\rb* \rb who|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb had gone up|עָל֤וּ\rb* \rb with him|עִמּוֹ֙\rb* \rb replied,|אָֽמְר֔וּ\rb* \rb “We cannot|לֹ֥א\rb*\rb |נוּכַ֖ל\rb* \rb go up|לַעֲל֣וֹת\rb* \rb against|אֶל־\rb* \rb the people,|הָעָ֑ם\rb* \rb for|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb they|ה֖וּא\rb* \rb are stronger|חָזָ֥ק\rb* \rb than we are!”|מִמֶּֽנּוּ׃\rb*
