\q1 \v 19 \rb God|אֵל֙\rb* \rb is not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb a man,|אִ֥ישׁ\rb* \rb that He should lie,|וִֽיכַזֵּ֔ב\rb*
\q2 \rb or a son|וּבֶן־\rb* \rb of man,|אָדָ֖ם\rb* \rb that He should change His mind.|וְיִתְנֶחָ֑ם\rb*
