\q2 \rb He has blessed,|וּבֵרֵ֖ךְ\rb* \rb and I cannot|וְלֹ֥א\rb* \rb change it.|אֲשִׁיבֶֽנָּה׃\rb*
\q1 \v 21 \rb He considers|הִבִּ֥יט\rb* \rb no|לֹֽא־\rb* \rb disaster|אָ֙וֶן֙\rb* \rb for Jacob;|בְּיַעֲקֹ֔ב\rb*
\q2 \rb He sees|רָאָ֥ה\rb* \rb no|וְלֹא־\rb* \rb trouble|עָמָ֖ל\rb* \rb for Israel.|בְּיִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb*
\q1 \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֤ה\rb* \rb their God|אֱלֹהָיו֙\rb* \rb is with them,|עִמּ֔וֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb and the shout|וּתְרוּעַ֥ת\rb* \rb of the King|מֶ֖לֶךְ\rb* \rb is among them.|בּֽוֹ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 22 \rb God|אֵ֖ל\rb* \rb brought them out|מוֹצִיאָ֣ם\rb* \rb of Egypt|מִמִּצְרָ֑יִם\rb*
\q2 \rb with strength|כְּתוֹעֲפֹ֥ת\rb* \rb like a wild ox.|רְאֵ֖ם\rb*
\q1 \v 23 \rb For|כִּ֤י\rb* \rb there is no|לֹא־\rb* \rb spell|נַ֙חַשׁ֙\rb* \rb against Jacob|בְּיַעֲקֹ֔ב\rb*
\q2 \rb and no|וְלֹא־\rb* \rb divination|קֶ֖סֶם\rb* \rb against Israel.|בְּיִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb*
\q1 \rb It will now|כָּעֵ֗ת\rb* \rb be said|יֵאָמֵ֤ר\rb* \rb of Jacob|לְיַעֲקֹב֙\rb* \rb and Israel,|וּלְיִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb*
\q2 \rb ‘What|מַה־\rb* \rb great things God|אֵֽל׃\rb* \rb has done!’|פָּ֖עַל\rb*
\q1 \v 24 \rb Behold,|הֶן־\rb* \rb the people|עָם֙\rb* \rb rise|יָק֔וּם\rb* \rb like a lioness;|כְּלָבִ֣יא\rb*
\q2 \rb they rouse themselves|יִתְנַשָּׂ֑א\rb* \rb like a lion,|וְכַאֲרִ֖י\rb*
\q1 \rb not|לֹ֤א\rb* \rb resting|יִשְׁכַּב֙\rb* \rb until|עַד־\rb* \rb they devour|יֹ֣אכַל\rb* \rb their prey|טֶ֔רֶף\rb*
\q2 \rb and drink|יִשְׁתֶּֽה׃\rb* \rb the blood|וְדַם־\rb* \rb of the slain.”|חֲלָלִ֖ים\rb*
\p \v 25 \rb Now Balak|בָּלָק֙\rb* \rb said|וַיֹּ֤אמֶר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Balaam,|בִּלְעָ֔ם\rb* \rb “Then|גַּם־\rb* \rb neither|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb curse them|תִקֳּבֶ֑נּוּ\rb* \rb at all|קֹ֖ב\rb*\rb |גַּם־\rb* \rb nor|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb bless them|בָּרֵ֖ךְ\rb* \rb at all!”|תְבָרֲכֶֽנּוּ׃\rb*
\p \v 26 \rb But Balaam|בִּלְעָ֔ם\rb*\rb |וַיֹּ֖אמֶר\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb replied,|וַיַּ֣עַן\rb*\rb |בָּלָ֑ק\rb* \rb “Did I not|הֲלֹ֗א\rb* \rb tell you that|דִּבַּ֤רְתִּי\rb*\rb |אֵלֶ֙יךָ֙\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹ֔ר\rb* \rb whatever|כֹּ֛ל\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֹת֥וֹ\rb* \rb says,|יְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb I must do?”|אֶֽעֱשֶֽׂה׃\rb*
\p \v 27 \rb “Please|נָּא֙\rb* \rb come,”|לְכָה־\rb* \rb said|וַיֹּ֤אמֶר\rb* \rb Balak,|בָּלָק֙\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb*\rb |בִּלְעָ֔ם\rb* \rb “I will take|אֶקָּ֣חֲךָ֔\rb* \rb you to|אֶל־\rb* \rb another|אַחֵ֑ר\rb* \rb place.|מָק֖וֹם\rb* \rb Perhaps|אוּלַ֤י\rb* \rb it will please|יִישַׁר֙\rb*\rb |בְּעֵינֵ֣י\rb* \rb God|הָאֱלֹהִ֔ים\rb* \rb that you curse them|וְקַבֹּ֥תוֹ\rb* \rb for me|לִ֖י\rb* \rb from there.”|מִשָּֽׁם׃\rb*
\p \v 28 \rb And Balak|בָּלָ֖ק\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb took|וַיִּקַּ֥ח\rb* \rb Balaam|בִּלְעָ֑ם\rb* \rb to the top|רֹ֣אשׁ\rb* \rb of Peor,|הַפְּע֔וֹר\rb* \rb which overlooks|הַנִּשְׁקָ֖ף\rb*\rb |עַל־\rb*\rb |פְּנֵ֥י\rb* \rb the wasteland.|הַיְשִׁימֹֽן׃\rb*\f + \fr 23:28 \ft Or \fqa Jeshimon\f*
\p \v 29 \rb Then Balaam|בִּלְעָם֙\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb said,|וַיֹּ֤אמֶר\rb*\rb |בָּלָ֔ק\rb* \rb “Build|בְּנֵה־\rb* \rb for me|לִ֥י\rb* \rb seven|שִׁבְעָ֣ה\rb* \rb altars|מִזְבְּחֹ֑ת\rb* \rb here,|בָזֶ֖ה\rb* \rb and prepare|וְהָכֵ֥ן\rb* \rb for me|לִי֙\rb*\rb |בָּזֶ֔ה\rb* \rb seven|שִׁבְעָ֥ה\rb* \rb bulls|פָרִ֖ים\rb* \rb and seven|וְשִׁבְעָ֥ה\rb* \rb rams.”|אֵילִֽים׃\rb*
\p \v 30 \rb So Balak|בָּלָ֔ק\rb* \rb did|וַיַּ֣עַשׂ\rb* \rb as|כַּאֲשֶׁ֖ר\rb* \rb Balaam|בִּלְעָ֑ם\rb* \rb had instructed,|אָמַ֣ר\rb* \rb and he offered|וַיַּ֛עַל\rb* \rb a bull|פָּ֥ר\rb* \rb and a ram|וָאַ֖יִל\rb* \rb on each altar.|בַּמִּזְבֵּֽחַ׃\rb*
\c 24
\s1 Balaam’s Third Oracle
\p \v 1 \rb And when Balaam|בִּלְעָ֗ם\rb* \rb saw|וַיַּ֣רְא\rb* \rb that|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb it pleased|ט֞וֹב\rb*\rb |בְּעֵינֵ֤י\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָה֙\rb* \rb to bless|לְבָרֵ֣ךְ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Israel,|יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb he did not|וְלֹא־\rb* \rb seek|הָלַ֥ךְ\rb* \rb omens|נְחָשִׁ֑ים\rb* \rb as on previous occasions,|כְּפַֽעַם־\rb*\rb |בְּפַ֖עַם\rb*\rb |לִקְרַ֣את\rb* \rb but he turned|וַיָּ֥שֶׁת\rb* \rb his face|פָּנָֽיו׃\rb* \rb toward|אֶל־\rb* \rb the wilderness.|הַמִּדְבָּ֖ר\rb* \v 2 \rb When Balaam|בִלְעָ֜ם\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb looked up|וַיִּשָּׂ֨א\rb*\rb |עֵינָ֗יו\rb* \rb and saw|וַיַּרְא֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Israel|יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb encamped|שֹׁכֵ֖ן\rb* \rb tribe by tribe,|לִשְׁבָטָ֑יו\rb* \rb the Spirit|ר֥וּחַ\rb* \rb of God|אֱלֹהִֽים׃\rb* \rb came|וַתְּהִ֥י\rb* \rb upon him,|עָלָ֖יו\rb* \v 3 \rb and he lifted up|וַיִּשָּׂ֥א\rb* \rb an oracle,|מְשָׁל֖וֹ\rb* \rb saying:|וַיֹּאמַ֑ר\rb*
\b 
\q1 \rb “This is the prophecy|נְאֻ֤ם\rb* \rb of Balaam|בִּלְעָם֙\rb* \rb son|בְּנ֣וֹ\rb* \rb of Beor,|בְעֹ֔ר\rb*
