\s1 Inheritance by Lot
\p \v 52 \rb Then the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb said|וַיְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |לֵּאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 53 \rb “The land|הָאָ֛רֶץ\rb* \rb is to be divided|תֵּחָלֵ֥ק\rb* \rb among the tribes|לָאֵ֗לֶּה\rb* \rb as an inheritance,|בְּנַחֲלָ֖ה\rb* \rb according to the number|בְּמִסְפַּ֥ר\rb* \rb of names.|שֵׁמֽוֹת׃\rb* \v 54 \rb Increase|תַּרְבֶּה֙\rb* \rb the inheritance|נַחֲלָת֔וֹ\rb* \rb for a large tribe|לָרַ֗ב\rb* \rb and decrease|תַּמְעִ֖יט\rb* \rb it|נַחֲלָת֑וֹ\rb* \rb for a small one;|וְלַמְעַ֕ט\rb* \rb each tribe|אִ֚ישׁ\rb* \rb is to receive|יֻתַּ֖ן\rb* \rb its inheritance|נַחֲלָתֽוֹ׃\rb* \rb according to|לְפִ֣י\rb* \rb the number of those registered.|פְקֻדָ֔יו\rb*
\p \v 55 \rb Indeed,|אַךְ־\rb* \rb the land|הָאָ֑רֶץ\rb* \rb must be divided|יֵחָלֵ֖ק\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb by lot;|בְּגוֹרָ֕ל\rb* \rb they shall receive their inheritance|יִנְחָֽלוּ׃\rb* \rb according to the names|לִשְׁמ֥וֹת\rb* \rb of the tribes|מַטּוֹת־\rb* \rb of their fathers.|אֲבֹתָ֖ם\rb* \v 56 \rb Each inheritance|נַחֲלָת֑וֹ\rb* \rb is to be divided|תֵּחָלֵ֖ק\rb* \rb by|עַל־\rb*\rb |פִּי֙\rb* \rb lot|הַגּוֹרָ֔ל\rb* \rb among|בֵּ֥ין\rb* \rb the larger|רַ֖ב\rb* \rb and smaller tribes.”|לִמְעָֽט׃ס\rb*
