\p \v 62 \rb The registration of the Levites|פְקֻדֵיהֶ֗ם\rb* \rb totaled|וַיִּהְי֣וּ\rb* \rb 23,000,|שְׁלֹשָׁ֤ה\rb*\rb |וְעֶשְׂרִים֙\rb*\rb |אֶ֔לֶף\rb* \rb every|כָּל־\rb* \rb male|זָכָ֖ר\rb* \rb a month|חֹ֣דֶשׁ\rb* \rb old|מִבֶּן־\rb* \rb or more;|וָמָ֑עְלָה\rb* \rb they were not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb numbered|הָתְפָּקְד֗וּ\rb* \rb among|בְּתוֹךְ֙\rb* \rb the other Israelites,|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb because|כִּ֠י\rb* \rb no|לֹא־\rb* \rb inheritance|נַחֲלָ֔ה\rb* \rb was given|נִתַּ֤ן\rb*\rb |לָהֶם֙\rb* \rb to them among|בְּת֖וֹךְ\rb* \rb the Israelites.|בְּנֵ֥י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃\rb*
\s1 Only Caleb and Joshua Remain
