\s1 The Daughters of Zelophehad
\r \ref Numbers 36:1–13|NUM 36:1-13\ref*)
\p \v 1 \rb Now the daughters|בְּנ֣וֹת\rb* \rb of Zelophehad|צְלָפְחָ֗ד\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Hepher,|חֵ֤פֶר\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Gilead,|גִּלְעָד֙\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Machir,|מָכִ֣יר\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Manasseh,|מְנַשֶּׁ֔ה\rb* \rb belonged to the clans|לְמִשְׁפְּחֹ֖ת\rb* \rb of Manasseh|מְנַשֶּׁ֣ה\rb* \rb son|בֶן־\rb* \rb of Joseph.|יוֹסֵ֑ף\rb* \rb These|וְאֵ֙לֶּה֙\rb* \rb were the names|שְׁמ֣וֹת\rb* \rb of his daughters:|בְּנֹתָ֔יו\rb* \rb Mahlah,|מַחְלָ֣ה\rb* \rb Noah,|נֹעָ֔ה\rb* \rb Hoglah,|וְחָגְלָ֥ה\rb* \rb Milcah,|וּמִלְכָּ֖ה\rb* \rb and Tirzah.|וְתִרְצָֽה׃\rb* \rb They approached|וַתִּקְרַ֜בְנָה\rb* \v 2 \rb the entrance|פֶּ֥תַח\rb* \rb to the Tent|אֹֽהֶל־\rb* \rb of Meeting,|מוֹעֵ֖ד\rb* \rb stood|וַֽתַּעֲמֹ֜דְנָה\rb* \rb before|לִפְנֵ֣י\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֗ה\rb*\rb |וְלִפְנֵי֙\rb* \rb Eleazar|אֶלְעָזָ֣ר\rb* \rb the priest,|הַכֹּהֵ֔ן\rb*\rb |וְלִפְנֵ֥י\rb* \rb the leaders,|הַנְּשִׂיאִ֖ם\rb* \rb and the whole|וְכָל־\rb* \rb congregation,|הָעֵדָ֑ה\rb* \rb and said,|לֵאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 3 \rb “Our father|אָבִינוּ֮\rb* \rb died|מֵ֣ת\rb* \rb in the wilderness,|בַּמִּדְבָּר֒\rb* \rb but he|וְה֨וּא\rb* \rb was|הָיָ֜ה\rb* \rb not|לֹא־\rb* \rb among|בְּת֣וֹךְ\rb* \rb the followers|הָעֵדָ֗ה\rb* \rb of Korah|קֹ֑רַח\rb* \rb who gathered together|הַנּוֹעָדִ֛ים\rb* \rb against|עַל־\rb* \rb the LORD.|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*\rb |בַּעֲדַת־\rb* \rb Instead,|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb he died|מֵ֔ת\rb* \rb because of his own sin,|בְחֶטְא֣וֹ\rb* \rb and he had|הָ֥יוּ\rb* \rb no|לֹא־\rb* \rb sons.|וּבָנִ֖ים\rb* \v 4 \rb Why|לָ֣מָּה\rb* \rb should the name|שֵׁם־\rb* \rb of our father|אָבִ֙ינוּ֙\rb* \rb disappear|יִגָּרַ֤ע\rb* \rb from|מִתּ֣וֹךְ\rb* \rb his clan|מִשְׁפַּחְתּ֔וֹ\rb* \rb because|כִּ֛י\rb* \rb he had no|אֵ֥ין\rb* \rb sons?|בֵּ֑ן\rb* \rb Give|תְּנָה־\rb* \rb us|לָּ֣נוּ\rb* \rb property|אֲחֻזָּ֔ה\rb* \rb among|בְּת֖וֹךְ\rb* \rb our father’s|אָבִֽינוּ׃\rb* \rb brothers.”|אֲחֵ֥י\rb*
\p \v 5 \rb So Moses|מֹשֶׁ֛ה\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb brought|וַיַּקְרֵ֥ב\rb* \rb their case|מִשְׁפָּטָ֖ן\rb* \rb before|לִפְנֵ֥י\rb* \rb the LORD,|יְהוָֽה׃ס\rb* \v 6 \rb and the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb answered|וַיֹּ֥אמֶר\rb* \rb him,|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |לֵּאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 7 \rb “The daughters|בְּנ֣וֹת\rb* \rb of Zelophehad|צְלָפְחָד֮\rb* \rb speak|דֹּבְרֹת֒\rb* \rb correctly.|כֵּ֗ן\rb* \rb You certainly must give|נָתֹ֨ן\rb*\rb |תִּתֵּ֤ן\rb* \rb them|לָהֶם֙\rb* \rb property|אֲחֻזַּ֣ת\rb* \rb as an inheritance|נַחֲלָ֔ה\rb* \rb among|בְּת֖וֹךְ\rb* \rb their father’s|אֲבִיהֶ֑ם\rb* \rb brothers|אֲחֵ֣י\rb* \rb and transfer|וְהַֽעֲבַרְתָּ֛\rb* \rb their|אֶת־\rb* \rb father’s|אֲבִיהֶ֖ן\rb* \rb inheritance|נַחֲלַ֥ת\rb* \rb to them.|לָהֶֽן׃\rb*
\p \v 8 \rb Furthermore,|וְאֶל־\rb* \rb you shall say|תְּדַבֵּ֣ר\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹ֑ר\rb* \rb to the Israelites,|בְּנֵ֥י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֖ל\rb* \rb ‘If|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb a man|אִ֣ישׁ\rb* \rb dies|יָמ֗וּת\rb* \rb and leaves no|אֵ֣ין\rb* \rb son,|וּבֵן֙\rb* \rb you are to transfer|וְהַֽעֲבַרְתֶּ֥ם\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb his inheritance|נַחֲלָת֖וֹ\rb* \rb to his daughter.|לְבִתּֽוֹ׃\rb* \v 9 \rb If|וְאִם־\rb* \rb he has no|אֵ֥ין\rb* \rb daughter,|בַּ֑ת\rb* \rb give|וּנְתַתֶּ֥ם\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb his inheritance|נַחֲלָת֖וֹ\rb* \rb to his brothers.|לְאֶחָיו׃\rb* \v 10 \rb If|וְאִם־\rb* \rb he has no|אֵ֥ין\rb* \rb brothers,|אַחִ֑ים\rb* \rb give|וּנְתַתֶּ֥ם\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb his inheritance|נַחֲלָת֖וֹ\rb* \rb to his father’s|אָבִֽיו׃\rb* \rb brothers.|לַאֲחֵ֥י\rb* \v 11 \rb And if|וְאִם־\rb* \rb his father|לְאָבִיו֒\rb* \rb has no|אֵ֣ין\rb* \rb brothers,|אַחִים֮\rb* \rb give|וּנְתַתֶּ֣ם\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb his inheritance|נַחֲלָת֗וֹ\rb* \rb to the next|הַקָּרֹ֥ב\rb*\rb |אֵלָ֛יו\rb* \rb of kin|לִשְׁאֵר֞וֹ\rb* \rb from his clan,|מִמִּשְׁפַּחְתּ֖וֹ\rb* \rb that he may take possession of it.|וְיָרַ֣שׁ\rb*\rb |אֹתָ֑הּ\rb* \rb This is to be|וְֽהָ֨יְתָ֜ה\rb* \rb a statutory|לְחֻקַּ֣ת\rb* \rb ordinance|מִשְׁפָּ֔ט\rb* \rb for the Israelites,|לִבְנֵ֤י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵל֙\rb* \rb as|כַּאֲשֶׁ֛ר\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb has commanded|צִוָּ֥ה\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Moses.’”|מֹשֶֽׁה׃ס\rb*
\s1 Moses Requests a Successor
\r \ref Deuteronomy 3:23–29|DEU 3:23-29\ref*)
\p \v 12 \rb Then the LORD|יְהוָה֙\rb* \rb said|וַיֹּ֤אמֶר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֔ה\rb* \rb “Go up|עֲלֵ֛ה\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb this|הַזֶּ֑ה\rb* \rb mountain|הַ֥ר\rb* \rb of the Abarim range|הָעֲבָרִ֖ים\rb*\f + \fr 27:12 \ft LXX \fqa Go up Mount Nebo beyond the Jordan\f* \rb and see|וּרְאֵה֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the land|הָאָ֔רֶץ\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb I have given|נָתַ֖תִּי\rb* \rb the Israelites.|לִבְנֵ֥י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃\rb* \v 13 \rb After you have seen it,|וְרָאִ֣יתָה\rb*\rb |אֹתָ֔הּ\rb* \rb you|אָ֑תָּה\rb* \rb too will|גַּם־\rb* \rb be gathered|וְנֶאֱסַפְתָּ֥\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb your people,|עַמֶּ֖יךָ\rb* \rb as|כַּאֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb your brother|אָחִֽיךָ׃\rb* \rb Aaron|אַהֲרֹ֥ן\rb* \rb was;|נֶאֱסַ֖ף\rb* \v 14 \rb for|כַּאֲשֶׁר֩\rb* \rb when the congregation|הָֽעֵדָ֔ה\rb* \rb contended|בִּמְרִיבַת֙\rb* \rb in the Wilderness|בְּמִדְבַּר־\rb* \rb of Zin,|צִ֗ן\rb* \rb both of you rebelled|מְרִיתֶ֨ם\rb* \rb against My command|פִּ֜י\rb* \rb to show My holiness|לְהַקְדִּישֵׁ֥נִי\rb* \rb in their sight|לְעֵינֵיהֶ֑ם\rb* \rb regarding the waters.”|בַמַּ֖יִם\rb* \rb Those|הֵ֛ם\rb* \rb were the waters|מֵֽי־\rb* \rb of Meribah|מְרִיבַ֥ת\rb*\f + \fr 27:14 \fqa Meribah \ft means \fqa quarreling\ft ; see \ref Exodus 17:7|EXO 17:7\ref*.\f* \rb in Kadesh,|קָדֵ֖שׁ\rb* \rb in the Wilderness|מִדְבַּר־\rb* \rb of Zin.|צִֽן׃פ\rb*
\p \v 15 \rb So Moses|מֹשֶׁ֔ה\rb* \rb appealed|וַיְדַבֵּ֣ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the LORD,|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 16 \rb “May the LORD,|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb the God|אֱלֹהֵ֥י\rb* \rb of the spirits|הָרוּחֹ֖ת\rb* \rb of all|לְכָל־\rb* \rb flesh,|בָּשָׂ֑ר\rb* \rb appoint|יִפְקֹ֣ד\rb* \rb a man|אִ֖ישׁ\rb* \rb over|עַל־\rb* \rb the congregation|הָעֵדָֽה׃\rb* \v 17 \rb who|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb will go out|יֵצֵ֣א\rb*\rb |לִפְנֵיהֶ֗ם\rb* \rb and come in|יָבֹא֙\rb* \rb before them,|לִפְנֵיהֶ֔ם\rb*\rb |וַאֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb and who|וַאֲשֶׁ֤ר\rb* \rb will lead them out|יוֹצִיאֵ֖ם\rb*\rb |וַאֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb and bring them in,|יְבִיאֵ֑ם\rb* \rb so that the congregation|עֲדַ֣ת\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb will not|וְלֹ֤א\rb* \rb be|תִהְיֶה֙\rb* \rb like sheep|כַּצֹּ֕אן\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb without|אֵין־\rb* \rb a shepherd.”|רֹעֶֽה׃\rb*
\s1 Joshua to Succeed Moses
\r \ref Deuteronomy 31:1–8|DEU 31:1-8\ref*)
\p \v 18 \rb And the LORD|יְהוָ֜ה\rb* \rb replied|וַיֹּ֨אמֶר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֗ה\rb* \rb “Take|קַח־\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Joshua|יְהוֹשֻׁ֣עַ\rb* \rb son|בִּן־\rb* \rb of Nun,|נ֔וּן\rb* \rb a man with|אִ֖ישׁ\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb the Spirit|ר֣וּחַ\rb* \rb in him,|בּ֑וֹ\rb* \rb and lay|וְסָמַכְתָּ֥\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb your hands|יָדְךָ֖\rb* \rb on him.|עָלָֽיו׃\rb* \v 19 \rb Have him stand|וְהַֽעֲמַדְתָּ֣\rb*\rb |אֹת֗וֹ\rb* \rb before|לִפְנֵי֙\rb* \rb Eleazar|אֶלְעָזָ֣ר\rb* \rb the priest|הַכֹּהֵ֔ן\rb*\rb |וְלִפְנֵ֖י\rb* \rb and the whole|כָּל־\rb* \rb congregation,|הָעֵדָ֑ה\rb* \rb and commission|וְצִוִּיתָ֥ה\rb* \rb him|אֹת֖וֹ\rb* \rb in their sight.|לְעֵינֵיהֶֽם׃\rb* \v 20 \rb Confer|וְנָתַתָּ֥ה\rb* \rb on him|עָלָ֑יו\rb* \rb some of your authority,|מֵהֽוֹדְךָ֖\rb* \rb so that|לְמַ֣עַן\rb* \rb the whole|כָּל־\rb* \rb congregation|עֲדַ֖ת\rb*\rb |בְּנֵ֥י\rb* \rb of Israel|יִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃\rb* \rb will obey him.|יִשְׁמְע֔וּ\rb* \v 21 \rb He shall stand|יַעֲמֹ֔ד\rb* \rb before|וְלִפְנֵ֨י\rb* \rb Eleazar|אֶלְעָזָ֤ר\rb* \rb the priest,|הַכֹּהֵן֙\rb* \rb who will seek counsel|וְשָׁ֥אַל\rb* \rb for him|ל֛וֹ\rb* \rb before the LORD|יְהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb by the judgment|בְּמִשְׁפַּ֥ט\rb* \rb of the Urim.|הָאוּרִ֖ים\rb*\f + \fr 27:21 \ft Literally \fqa the Lights\f* \rb At|עַל־\rb* \rb his command,|פִּ֨יו\rb*\rb |לִפְנֵ֣י\rb* \rb he|ה֛וּא\rb* \rb and all|וְכָל־\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְּנֵי־\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֥ל\rb* \rb with him—|אִתּ֖וֹ\rb* \rb the entire|וְכָל־\rb* \rb congregation—|הָעֵדָֽה׃\rb* \rb will go out|יֵצְא֜וּ\rb*\rb |וְעַל־\rb*\rb |פִּ֣יו\rb* \rb and come in.”|יָבֹ֗אוּ\rb*
\p \v 22 \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁ֔ה\rb* \rb did|וַיַּ֣עַשׂ\rb* \rb as|כַּאֲשֶׁ֛ר\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֹת֑וֹ\rb* \rb had commanded him.|צִוָּ֥ה\rb* \rb He took|וַיִּקַּ֣ח\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Joshua,|יְהוֹשֻׁ֗עַ\rb* \rb had him stand|וַיַּֽעֲמִדֵ֙הוּ֙\rb* \rb before|לִפְנֵי֙\rb* \rb Eleazar|אֶלְעָזָ֣ר\rb* \rb the priest|הַכֹּהֵ֔ן\rb*\rb |וְלִפְנֵ֖י\rb* \rb and the whole|כָּל־\rb* \rb congregation,|הָעֵדָֽה׃\rb* \v 23 \rb and laid|וַיִּסְמֹ֧ךְ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb his hands|יָדָ֛יו\rb* \rb on him|עָלָ֖יו\rb* \rb and commissioned him,|וַיְצַוֵּ֑הוּ\rb* \rb as|כַּאֲשֶׁ֛ר\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb had instructed|דִּבֶּ֥ר\rb* \rb through|בְּיַד־\rb* \rb Moses.|מֹשֶֽׁה׃פ\rb*
\c 28
\s1 The Daily Offerings
\r \ref Exodus 29:38–44|EXO 29:38-44\ref*)
\p \v 1 \rb Then the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb said|וַיְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |לֵּאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 2 \rb “Command|צַ֚ו\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb and say|וְאָמַרְתָּ֖\rb* \rb to them:|אֲלֵהֶ֑ם\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb See|תִּשְׁמְר֕וּ\rb* \rb that you present|לְהַקְרִ֥יב\rb* \rb to Me|לִ֖י\rb* \rb at its appointed time|בְּמוֹעֲדֽוֹ׃\rb* \rb the food|לַחְמִ֜י\rb*\rb |קָרְבָּנִ֨י\rb* \rb for My food offerings,|לְאִשַּׁ֗י\rb* \rb as a pleasing|נִֽיחֹחִ֔י\rb* \rb aroma to Me.|רֵ֚יחַ\rb*
\p \v 3 \rb And tell them|וְאָמַרְתָּ֣\rb* \rb that|לָהֶ֔ם\rb* \rb this is|זֶ֚ה\rb* \rb the food offering|הָֽאִשֶּׁ֔ה\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb you are to present|תַּקְרִ֖יבוּ\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַיהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb as a regular|תָמִֽיד׃\rb* \rb burnt offering|עֹלָ֥ה\rb* \rb each day:|לַיּ֖וֹם\rb* \rb two|שְׁנַ֥יִם\rb* \rb unblemished|תְמִימִ֛ם\rb* \rb year-old|בְּנֵֽי־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֧ה\rb* \rb male lambs.|כְּבָשִׂ֨ים\rb* \v 4 \rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Offer|תַּעֲשֶׂ֣ה\rb* \rb one|אֶחָ֖ד\rb* \rb lamb|הַכֶּ֥בֶשׂ\rb* \rb in the morning|בַבֹּ֑קֶר\rb*\rb |וְאֵת֙\rb* \rb and the other|הַשֵּׁנִ֔י\rb*\rb |תַּעֲשֶׂ֖ה\rb*\rb |הַכֶּ֣בֶשׂ\rb* \rb at|בֵּ֥ין\rb* \rb twilight,|הָֽעַרְבָּֽיִם׃\rb*\f + \fr 28:4 \ft Hebrew \fqa between the two evenings\ft ; also in verse 8\f* \v 5 \rb along with a tenth|וַעֲשִׂירִ֧ית\rb* \rb of an ephah|הָאֵיפָ֛ה\rb* \rb of fine flour|סֹ֖לֶת\rb*\f + \fr 28:5 \fqa A tenth of an ephah \ft is approximately 2 dry quarts or 2.2 liters (probably about 2.6 pounds or 1.2 kilograms of flour); also in verses 13, 21, and 29.\f* \rb as a grain offering,|לְמִנְחָ֑ה\rb* \rb mixed|בְּלוּלָ֛ה\rb* \rb with a quarter|רְבִיעִ֥ת\rb* \rb hin|הַהִֽין׃\rb* \rb of oil|בְּשֶׁ֥מֶן\rb* \rb from pressed olives.|כָּתִ֖ית\rb*\f + \fr 28:5 \ft Or \fqa a quarter hin of pure olive oil\ft ; Hebrew \fqa a quarter hin of pressed oil\ft ; that is, approximately 0.97 quarts or 0.92 liters; similarly in verses 7 and 14\f*
\p \v 6 \rb This is a regular|תָּמִ֑יד\rb* \rb burnt offering|עֹלַ֖ת\rb* \rb established|הָעֲשֻׂיָה֙\rb* \rb at Mount|בְּהַ֣ר\rb* \rb Sinai|סִינַ֔י\rb* \rb as a pleasing|נִיחֹ֔חַ\rb* \rb aroma,|לְרֵ֣יחַ\rb* \rb a food offering|אִשֶּׁ֖ה\rb* \rb to the LORD.|לַֽיהוָֽה׃\rb* \v 7 \rb The drink offering|וְנִסְכּוֹ֙\rb* \rb accompanying each|הָאֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb lamb|לַכֶּ֖בֶשׂ\rb* \rb shall be a quarter|רְבִיעִ֣ת\rb* \rb hin.|הַהִ֔ין\rb* \rb Pour out|הַסֵּ֛ךְ\rb* \rb the offering|נֶ֥סֶךְ\rb* \rb of fermented drink|שֵׁכָ֖ר\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַיהוָֽה׃\rb* \rb in the sanctuary area.|בַּקֹּ֗דֶשׁ\rb* \v 8 \rb And|וְאֵת֙\rb* \rb offer|תַּעֲשֶׂ֖ה\rb* \rb the second|הַשֵּׁנִ֔י\rb* \rb lamb|הַכֶּ֣בֶשׂ\rb* \rb at|בֵּ֣ין\rb* \rb twilight,|הָֽעַרְבָּ֑יִם\rb* \rb with the same grain offering|כְּמִנְחַ֨ת\rb* \rb and drink offering|וּכְנִסְכּוֹ֙\rb*\rb |תַּעֲשֶׂ֔ה\rb* \rb as in the morning.|הַבֹּ֤קֶר\rb* \rb It is a food offering,|אִשֵּׁ֛ה\rb* \rb a pleasing|נִיחֹ֖חַ\rb* \rb aroma|רֵ֥יחַ\rb* \rb to the LORD.|לַיהוָֽה׃פ\rb*
\s1 The Sabbath Offerings
\p \v 9 \rb On the Sabbath|הַשַּׁבָּ֔ת\rb* \rb day,|וּבְיוֹם֙\rb* \rb present two|שְׁנֵֽי־\rb* \rb unblemished|תְּמִימִ֑ם\rb* \rb year-old|בְּנֵֽי־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֖ה\rb* \rb male lambs,|כְבָשִׂ֥ים\rb* \rb accompanied by a grain offering|מִנְחָ֛ה\rb* \rb of two-tenths of an ephah|וּשְׁנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרֹנִ֗ים\rb* \rb of fine flour|סֹ֧לֶת\rb*\f + \fr 28:9 \fqa Two-tenths of an ephah \ft is approximately 4 dry quarts or 4.4 liters (probably about 5.1 pounds or 2.3 kilograms of flour); also in verses 12, 20, and 28.\f* \rb mixed|בְּלוּלָ֥ה\rb* \rb with oil,|בַשֶּׁ֖מֶן\rb* \rb as well as a drink offering.|וְנִסְכּֽוֹ׃\rb*
\p \v 10 \rb This is the burnt offering|עֹלַ֥ת\rb* \rb for every Sabbath,|שַׁבַּ֖ת\rb*\rb |בְּשַׁבַּתּ֑וֹ\rb* \rb in addition to|עַל־\rb* \rb the regular|הַתָּמִ֖יד\rb* \rb burnt offering|עֹלַ֥ת\rb* \rb and its drink offering.|וְנִסְכָּֽהּ׃ס\rb*
\s1 The Monthly Offerings
\p \v 11 \rb At the beginning|וּבְרָאשֵׁי֙\rb* \rb of every month,|חָדְשֵׁיכֶ֔ם\rb* \rb you are to present|תַּקְרִ֥יבוּ\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַיהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb a burnt offering|עֹלָ֖ה\rb* \rb of two|שְׁנַ֙יִם֙\rb* \rb young|בְּנֵֽי־\rb*\rb |בָקָ֤ר\rb* \rb bulls,|פָּרִ֨ים\rb* \rb one|אֶחָ֔ד\rb* \rb ram,|וְאַ֣יִל\rb* \rb and seven|שִׁבְעָ֖ה\rb* \rb male lambs|כְּבָשִׂ֧ים\rb* \rb a year old,|בְּנֵי־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֛ה\rb* \rb all unblemished,|תְּמִימִֽם׃\rb* \v 12 \rb along with three-tenths of an ephah|וּשְׁלֹשָׁ֣ה\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרֹנִ֗ים\rb* \rb of fine flour|סֹ֤לֶת\rb*\f + \fr 28:12 \fqa Three-tenths of an ephah \ft is approximately 6 dry quarts or 6.6 liters (probably about 7.6 pounds or 3.5 kilograms of flour); also in verses 20 and 28.\f* \rb mixed|בְּלוּלָ֣ה\rb* \rb with oil|בַשֶּׁ֔מֶן\rb* \rb as a grain offering|מִנְחָה֙\rb* \rb with each|הָאֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb bull,|לַפָּ֖ר\rb* \rb two-tenths of an ephah|וּשְׁנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרֹנִ֗ים\rb* \rb of fine flour|סֹ֤לֶת\rb* \rb mixed|בְּלוּלָ֣ה\rb* \rb with oil|בַשֶּׁ֔מֶן\rb* \rb as a grain offering|מִנְחָה֙\rb* \rb with the ram,|לָאַ֖יִל\rb*\rb |הָֽאֶחָֽד׃\rb* \v 13 \rb and a tenth of an ephah|וְעִשָּׂרֹ֣ן\rb*\rb |עִשָּׂר֗וֹן\rb* \rb of fine flour|סֹ֤לֶת\rb* \rb mixed|בְּלוּלָ֣ה\rb* \rb with oil|בַשֶּׁ֔מֶן\rb* \rb as a grain offering|מִנְחָה֙\rb* \rb with each|הָאֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb lamb.|לַכֶּ֖בֶשׂ\rb* \rb This is a burnt offering,|עֹלָה֙\rb* \rb a pleasing|נִיחֹ֔חַ\rb* \rb aroma,|רֵ֣יחַ\rb* \rb a food offering|אִשֶּׁ֖ה\rb* \rb to the LORD.|לַיהוָֽה׃\rb*
\p \v 14 \rb Their drink offerings|וְנִסְכֵּיהֶ֗ם\rb* \rb shall be|יִהְיֶ֨ה\rb* \rb half|חֲצִ֣י\rb* \rb a hin|הַהִין֩\rb* \rb of wine|יָ֑יִן\rb*\f + \fr 28:14 \fqa Half a hin \ft is approximately 1.9 quarts or 1.8 liters of wine.\f* \rb with each bull,|לַפָּ֜ר\rb* \rb a third|וּשְׁלִישִׁ֧ת\rb* \rb of a hin|הַהִ֣ין\rb*\f + \fr 28:14 \fqa A third of a hin \ft is approximately 1.3 quarts or 1.2 liters of wine.\f* \rb with the ram,|לָאַ֗יִל\rb* \rb and a quarter|וּרְבִיעִ֥ת\rb* \rb hin|הַהִ֛ין\rb* \rb with each lamb.|לַכֶּ֖בֶשׂ\rb* \rb This|זֹ֣את\rb* \rb is the monthly|חֹ֙דֶשׁ֙\rb* \rb burnt offering|עֹלַ֥ת\rb* \rb to be made at each new moon|בְּחָדְשׁ֔וֹ\rb*\rb |לְחָדְשֵׁ֖י\rb* \rb throughout the year.|הַשָּׁנָֽה׃\rb*
\p \v 15 \rb In addition to|עַל־\rb* \rb the regular|הַתָּמִ֛יד\rb* \rb burnt offering|עֹלַ֧ת\rb* \rb with its drink offering,|וְנִסְכּֽוֹ׃ס\rb* \rb one|אֶחָ֛ד\rb* \rb male goat|וּשְׂעִ֨יר\rb*\rb |עִזִּ֥ים\rb* \rb is to be presented|יֵעָשֶׂ֖ה\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַיהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb as a sin offering.|לְחַטָּ֖את\rb*
\s1 Passover and the Feast of Unleavened Bread
\r \ref Exodus 12:14–28|EXO 12:14-28\ref*; \ref Leviticus 23:4–8|LEV 23:4-8\ref*; \ref Deuteronomy 16:1–8|DEU 16:1-8\ref*)
\p \v 16 \rb The fourteenth|בְּאַרְבָּעָ֥ה\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֛ר\rb* \rb day|י֖וֹם\rb*\rb |לַחֹ֑דֶשׁ\rb* \rb of the first|הָרִאשׁ֗וֹן\rb* \rb month|וּבַחֹ֣דֶשׁ\rb* \rb is the LORD’s|לַיהוָֽה׃\rb* \rb Passover.|פֶּ֖סַח\rb* \v 17 \rb On the fifteenth|וּבַחֲמִשָּׁ֨ה\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֥ר\rb* \rb day|י֛וֹם\rb* \rb of this|הַזֶּ֖ה\rb* \rb month,|לַחֹ֥דֶשׁ\rb* \rb there shall be a feast;|חָ֑ג\rb* \rb for seven|שִׁבְעַ֣ת\rb* \rb days|יָמִ֔ים\rb* \rb unleavened bread|מַצּ֖וֹת\rb* \rb is to be eaten.|יֵאָכֵֽל׃\rb*
\p \v 18 \rb On the first|הָרִאשׁ֖וֹן\rb* \rb day|בַּיּ֥וֹם\rb* \rb there is to be a sacred|קֹ֑דֶשׁ\rb* \rb assembly;|מִקְרָא־\rb* \rb you must not|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb do|תַעֲשֽׂוּ׃\rb* \rb any|כָּל־\rb* \rb regular work.|מְלֶ֥אכֶת\rb*\rb |עֲבֹדָ֖ה\rb* \v 19 \rb Present|וְהִקְרַבְתֶּ֨ם\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַֽיהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb a food offering,|אִשֶּׁ֤ה\rb* \rb a burnt offering|עֹלָה֙\rb* \rb of two|שְׁנַ֖יִם\rb* \rb young|בְּנֵי־\rb*\rb |בָקָ֛ר\rb* \rb bulls,|פָּרִ֧ים\rb* \rb one|אֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb ram,|וְאַ֣יִל\rb* \rb and seven|וְשִׁבְעָ֤ה\rb* \rb male lambs|כְבָשִׂים֙\rb* \rb a year old,|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֔ה\rb* \rb all|יִהְי֥וּ\rb* \rb unblemished.|תְּמִימִ֖ם\rb* \v 20 \rb The grain offering|וּמִ֨נְחָתָ֔ם\rb* \rb shall consist of fine flour|סֹ֖לֶת\rb* \rb mixed|בְּלוּלָ֣ה\rb* \rb with oil;|בַשָּׁ֑מֶן\rb* \rb offer|תַּעֲשֽׂוּ׃\rb* \rb three-tenths of an ephah|שְׁלֹשָׁ֨ה\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרֹנִ֜ים\rb* \rb with each bull,|לַפָּ֗ר\rb* \rb two-tenths of an ephah|וּשְׁנֵ֧י\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרֹנִ֛ים\rb* \rb with the ram,|לָאַ֖יִל\rb* \v 21 \rb and|תַּעֲשֶׂ֔ה\rb* \rb a tenth of an ephah|עִשָּׂר֤וֹן\rb*\rb |עִשָּׂרוֹן֙\rb* \rb with each|הָאֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb of the seven|לְשִׁבְעַ֖ת\rb*\rb |הַכְּבָשִֽׂים׃\rb* \rb lambs.|לַכֶּ֖בֶשׂ\rb* \v 22 \rb Include one|אֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb male goat|וּשְׂעִ֥יר\rb* \rb as a sin offering|חַטָּ֖את\rb* \rb to make atonement|לְכַפֵּ֖ר\rb* \rb for you.|עֲלֵיכֶֽם׃\rb*
\p \v 23 \rb You are to present|תַּעֲשׂ֖וּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb these|אֵֽלֶּה׃\rb* \rb in addition to|מִלְּבַד֙\rb* \rb the|אֲשֶׁ֖ר\rb* \rb regular|הַתָּמִ֑יד\rb*\rb |לְעֹלַ֣ת\rb* \rb morning|הַבֹּ֔קֶר\rb* \rb burnt offering.|עֹלַ֣ת\rb* \v 24 \rb Offer|תַּעֲשׂ֤וּ\rb* \rb the same|כָּאֵ֜לֶּה\rb* \rb food|לֶ֛חֶם\rb* \rb each day|לַיּוֹם֙\rb* \rb for seven|שִׁבְעַ֣ת\rb* \rb days|יָמִ֔ים\rb* \rb as a food offering,|אִשֵּׁ֥ה\rb* \rb a pleasing|נִיחֹ֖חַ\rb* \rb aroma|רֵֽיחַ־\rb* \rb to the LORD.|לַיהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb It is to be offered|יֵעָשֶׂ֖ה\rb* \rb with|עַל־\rb* \rb its drink offering|וְנִסְכּֽוֹ׃\rb* \rb and the regular|הַתָּמִ֛יד\rb* \rb burnt offering.|עוֹלַ֧ת\rb*
\p \v 25 \rb On the seventh|הַשְּׁבִיעִ֔י\rb* \rb day|וּבַיּוֹם֙\rb* \rb you shall hold|יִהְיֶ֣ה\rb* \rb a sacred|קֹ֖דֶשׁ\rb* \rb assembly;|מִקְרָא־\rb* \rb you must not|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb do|תַעֲשֽׂוּ׃ס\rb* \rb any|כָּל־\rb* \rb regular work.|מְלֶ֥אכֶת\rb*\rb |עֲבֹדָ֖ה\rb*
\s1 The Feast of Weeks
\r \ref Deuteronomy 16:9–12|DEU 16:9-12\ref*)
\p \v 26 \rb On the day|וּבְי֣וֹם\rb* \rb of firstfruits,|הַבִּכּוּרִ֗ים\rb* \rb when you present|בְּהַקְרִ֨יבְכֶ֜ם\rb* \rb an offering of new|חֲדָשָׁה֙\rb* \rb grain|מִנְחָ֤ה\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַֽיהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb during the Feast of Weeks,|בְּשָׁבֻעֹ֖תֵיכֶ֑ם\rb*\f + \fr 28:26 \ft That is, Shavuot, the late spring feast of pilgrimage to Jerusalem; it is also known as \fqa the Feast of Harvest\ft (see \ref Exodus 23:16|EXO 23:16\ref*) or \fqa the Feast of Pentecost\ft (see \ref Acts 2:1|ACT 2:1\ref*).\f* \rb you are to hold|יִהְיֶ֣ה\rb* \rb a sacred|קֹ֙דֶשׁ֙\rb* \rb assembly;|מִֽקְרָא־\rb* \rb you must not|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb do|תַעֲשֽׂוּ׃\rb* \rb any|כָּל־\rb* \rb regular work.|מְלֶ֥אכֶת\rb*\rb |עֲבֹדָ֖ה\rb*
\p \v 27 \rb Present|וְהִקְרַבְתֶּ֨ם\rb* \rb a burnt offering|עוֹלָ֜ה\rb* \rb of two|שְׁנַ֖יִם\rb* \rb young|בְּנֵי־\rb*\rb |בָקָ֛ר\rb* \rb bulls,|פָּרִ֧ים\rb* \rb one|אֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb ram,|אַ֣יִל\rb* \rb and seven|שִׁבְעָ֥ה\rb* \rb male lambs|כְבָשִׂ֖ים\rb* \rb a year old|בְּנֵ֥י\rb*\rb |שָׁנָֽה׃\rb* \rb as a pleasing|נִיחֹ֙חַ֙\rb* \rb aroma|לְרֵ֤יחַ\rb* \rb to the LORD,|לַֽיהוָ֔ה\rb* \v 28 \rb together with their grain offerings|וּמִנְחָתָ֔ם\rb* \rb of fine flour|סֹ֖לֶת\rb* \rb mixed|בְּלוּלָ֣ה\rb* \rb with oil—|בַשָּׁ֑מֶן\rb* \rb three-tenths of an ephah|שְׁלֹשָׁ֤ה\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרֹנִים֙\rb* \rb with each|הָֽאֶחָ֔ד\rb* \rb bull,|לַפָּ֣ר\rb* \rb two-tenths of an ephah|שְׁנֵי֙\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרֹנִ֔ים\rb* \rb with the ram,|לָאַ֖יִל\rb*\rb |הָאֶחָֽד׃\rb* \v 29 \rb and a tenth of an ephah|עִשָּׂרוֹן֙\rb*\rb |עִשָּׂר֔וֹן\rb* \rb with each|הָאֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb of the seven|לְשִׁבְעַ֖ת\rb*\rb |הַכְּבָשִֽׂים׃\rb* \rb lambs.|לַכֶּ֖בֶשׂ\rb*
\p \v 30 \rb Include one|אֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb male goat|שְׂעִ֥יר\rb*\rb |עִזִּ֖ים\rb* \rb to make atonement|לְכַפֵּ֖ר\rb* \rb for you.|עֲלֵיכֶֽם׃\rb* \v 31 \rb Offer them|תַּעֲשׂ֑וּ\rb* \rb with their drink offerings|וְנִסְכֵּיהֶֽם׃פ\rb* \rb in addition to|מִלְּבַ֞ד\rb* \rb the regular|הַתָּמִ֛יד\rb* \rb burnt offering|עֹלַ֧ת\rb* \rb and its grain offering.|וּמִנְחָת֖וֹ\rb* \rb The animals must be|יִהְיוּ־\rb* \rb unblemished.|תְּמִימִ֥ם\rb*[’’]
\c 29
\s1 The Feast of Trumpets
\r \ref Leviticus 23:23–25|LEV 23:23-25\ref*)
\p \v 1 \rb “On the first|בְּאֶחָ֣ד\rb* \rb day|לַחֹ֗דֶשׁ\rb* \rb of the seventh|הַשְּׁבִיעִ֜י\rb* \rb month,|וּבַחֹ֨דֶשׁ\rb* \rb you are to hold|יִהְיֶ֣ה\rb* \rb a sacred|קֹ֙דֶשׁ֙\rb* \rb assembly,|מִֽקְרָא־\rb* \rb and you must not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb do|תַעֲשׂ֑וּ\rb* \rb any|כָּל־\rb* \rb regular work.|מְלֶ֥אכֶת\rb*\rb |עֲבֹדָ֖ה\rb* \rb This will be|יִהְיֶ֥ה\rb* \rb a day|י֥וֹם\rb* \rb for you|לָכֶֽם׃\rb* \rb to sound the trumpets.|תְּרוּעָ֖ה\rb*
\p \v 2 \rb As a pleasing|נִיחֹ֙חַ֙\rb* \rb aroma|לְרֵ֤יחַ\rb* \rb to the LORD,|לַֽיהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb you are to present|וַעֲשִׂיתֶ֨ם\rb* \rb a burnt offering|עֹלָ֜ה\rb* \rb of one|אֶחָ֖ד\rb* \rb young|בֶּן־\rb*\rb |בָּקָ֛ר\rb* \rb bull,|פַּ֧ר\rb* \rb one|אֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb ram,|אַ֣יִל\rb* \rb and seven|שִׁבְעָ֖ה\rb* \rb male lambs|כְּבָשִׂ֧ים\rb* \rb a year old,|בְּנֵי־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֛ה\rb* \rb all unblemished,|תְּמִימִֽם׃\rb* \v 3 \rb together with their grain offerings|וּמִנְחָתָ֔ם\rb* \rb of fine flour|סֹ֖לֶת\rb* \rb mixed|בְּלוּלָ֣ה\rb* \rb with oil—|בַשָּׁ֑מֶן\rb* \rb three-tenths of an ephah|שְׁלֹשָׁ֤ה\rb*\f + \fr 29:3 \fqa Three-tenths of an ephah \ft is approximately 6 dry quarts or 6.6 liters (probably about 7.6 pounds or 3.5 kilograms of flour); also in verses 9 and 14.\f*\rb |עֶשְׂרֹנִים֙\rb* \rb with the bull,|לַפָּ֔ר\rb* \rb two-tenths of an ephah|שְׁנֵ֥י\rb*\f + \fr 29:3 \fqa Two-tenths of an ephah \ft is approximately 4 dry quarts or 4.4 liters (probably about 5.1 pounds or 2.3 kilograms of flour); also in verses 9 and 14.\f*\rb |עֶשְׂרֹנִ֖ים\rb* \rb with the ram,|לָאָֽיִל׃\rb* \v 4 \rb and a tenth of an ephah|וְעִשָּׂר֣וֹן\rb*\f + \fr 29:4 \fqa A tenth of an ephah \ft is approximately 2 dry quarts or 2.2 liters (probably about 2.6 pounds or 1.2 kilograms of flour); also in verses 10 and 15.\f*\rb |אֶחָ֔ד\rb* \rb with each|הָאֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb of the seven|לְשִׁבְעַ֖ת\rb*\rb |הַכְּבָשִֽׂים׃\rb* \rb male lambs.|לַכֶּ֖בֶשׂ\rb*
\p \v 5 \rb Include one|אֶחָ֖ד\rb* \rb male goat|וּשְׂעִיר־\rb*\rb |עִזִּ֥ים\rb* \rb as a sin offering|חַטָּ֑את\rb* \rb to make atonement|לְכַפֵּ֖ר\rb* \rb for you.|עֲלֵיכֶֽם׃\rb* \v 6 \rb These are in addition to|מִלְּבַד֩\rb* \rb the monthly|הַחֹ֜דֶשׁ\rb* \rb and daily|הַתָּמִיד֙\rb*\rb |וּמִנְחָתָ֔הּ\rb* \rb burnt offerings|עֹלַ֨ת\rb* \rb with their prescribed|כְּמִשְׁפָּטָ֑ם\rb* \rb grain offerings|וּמִנְחָתָ֗הּ\rb*\rb |וְעֹלַ֤ת\rb* \rb and drink offerings.|וְנִסְכֵּיהֶ֖ם\rb* \rb They are a pleasing|נִיחֹ֔חַ\rb* \rb aroma,|לְרֵ֣יחַ\rb* \rb a food offering|אִשֶּׁ֖ה\rb* \rb to the LORD.|לַיהוָֽה׃ס\rb*
\s1 The Day of Atonement
\r \ref Leviticus 16:1–34|LEV 16:1-34\ref*; \ref Leviticus 23:26–32|LEV 23:26-32\ref*)
\p \v 7 \rb On the tenth|וּבֶעָשׂוֹר֩\rb* \rb day of this|הַזֶּ֗ה\rb* \rb seventh|הַשְּׁבִיעִ֜י\rb* \rb month,|לַחֹ֨דֶשׁ\rb* \rb you are to hold|יִהְיֶ֣ה\rb* \rb a sacred|קֹ֙דֶשׁ֙\rb* \rb assembly,|מִֽקְרָא־\rb* \rb and you shall humble|וְעִנִּיתֶ֖ם\rb* \rb yourselves;|נַפְשֹׁתֵיכֶ֑ם\rb*\f + \fr 29:7 \ft Or \fqa afflict your souls \ft or \fqa deny yourselves\f* \rb you must not|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb do|תַעֲשֽׂוּ׃\rb* \rb any|כָּל־\rb* \rb work.|מְלָאכָ֖ה\rb*
\p \v 8 \rb Present|וְהִקְרַבְתֶּ֨ם\rb* \rb as a pleasing|נִיחֹ֔חַ\rb* \rb aroma|רֵ֣יחַ\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַֽיהוָה֙\rb* \rb a burnt offering|עֹלָ֤ה\rb* \rb of one|אֶחָ֖ד\rb* \rb young|בֶּן־\rb*\rb |בָּקָ֛ר\rb* \rb bull,|פַּ֧ר\rb* \rb one|אֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb ram,|אַ֣יִל\rb* \rb and seven|שִׁבְעָ֔ה\rb* \rb male lambs|כְּבָשִׂ֤ים\rb* \rb a year old,|בְּנֵֽי־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָה֙\rb* \rb all|יִהְי֥וּ\rb* \rb unblemished,|תְּמִימִ֖ם\rb* \v 9 \rb together with their grain offerings|וּמִנְחָתָ֔ם\rb* \rb of fine flour|סֹ֖לֶת\rb* \rb mixed|בְּלוּלָ֣ה\rb* \rb with oil—|בַשָּׁ֑מֶן\rb* \rb three-tenths of an ephah|שְׁלֹשָׁ֤ה\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרֹנִים֙\rb* \rb with the bull,|לַפָּ֔ר\rb* \rb two-tenths of an ephah|שְׁנֵי֙\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרֹנִ֔ים\rb* \rb with the ram,|לָאַ֖יִל\rb*\rb |הָאֶחָֽד׃\rb* \v 10 \rb and a tenth of an ephah|עִשָּׂרוֹן֙\rb*\rb |עִשָּׂר֔וֹן\rb* \rb with each|הָאֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb of the seven|לְשִׁבְעַ֖ת\rb*\rb |הַכְּבָשִֽׂים׃\rb* \rb lambs.|לַכֶּ֖בֶשׂ\rb*
\p \v 11 \rb Include one|אֶחָ֖ד\rb* \rb male goat|שְׂעִיר־\rb*\rb |עִזִּ֥ים\rb* \rb for a sin offering,|חַטָּ֑את\rb* \rb in addition to|מִלְּבַ֞ד\rb* \rb the sin offering|חַטַּ֤את\rb* \rb of atonement|הַכִּפֻּרִים֙\rb* \rb and the regular|הַתָּמִ֔יד\rb* \rb burnt offering|וְעֹלַ֣ת\rb* \rb with its grain offering|וּמִנְחָתָ֖הּ\rb* \rb and drink offerings.|וְנִסְכֵּיהֶֽם׃פ\rb*
\s1 The Feast of Tabernacles
\r \ref Deuteronomy 16:13–17|DEU 16:13-17\ref*)
\p \v 12 \rb On the fifteenth|וּבַחֲמִשָּׁה֩\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֨ר\rb* \rb day|י֜וֹם\rb* \rb of the seventh|הַשְּׁבִיעִ֗י\rb* \rb month,|לַחֹ֣דֶשׁ\rb* \rb you are to hold|יִהְיֶ֣ה\rb* \rb a sacred|קֹ֙דֶשׁ֙\rb* \rb assembly;|מִֽקְרָא־\rb* \rb you must not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb do|תַעֲשׂ֑וּ\rb* \rb any|כָּל־\rb* \rb regular work,|מְלֶ֥אכֶת\rb*\rb |עֲבֹדָ֖ה\rb* \rb and you shall observe|וְחַגֹּתֶ֥ם\rb* \rb a feast|חַ֛ג\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַיהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb for seven|שִׁבְעַ֥ת\rb* \rb days.|יָמִֽים׃\rb*
\p \v 13 \rb As a pleasing|נִיחֹ֙חַ֙\rb* \rb aroma|רֵ֤יחַ\rb* \rb to the LORD,|לַֽיהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb you are to present|וְהִקְרַבְתֶּ֨ם\rb* \rb a food offering,|אִשֵּׁ֨ה\rb* \rb a burnt offering|עֹלָ֜ה\rb* \rb of thirteen|שְׁלֹשָׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֖ר\rb* \rb young|בְּנֵי־\rb*\rb |בָקָ֛ר\rb* \rb bulls,|פָּרִ֧ים\rb* \rb two|שְׁנָ֑יִם\rb* \rb rams,|אֵילִ֣ם\rb* \rb and fourteen|אַרְבָּעָ֥ה\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֖ר\rb* \rb male lambs|כְּבָשִׂ֧ים\rb* \rb a year old,|בְּנֵֽי־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֛ה\rb* \rb all|יִהְיֽוּ׃\rb* \rb unblemished,|תְּמִימִ֥ם\rb* \v 14 \rb along with the grain offering|וּמִנְחָתָ֔ם\rb* \rb of three-tenths of an ephah|שְׁלֹשָׁ֨ה\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרֹנִ֜ים\rb* \rb of fine flour|סֹ֖לֶת\rb* \rb mixed|בְּלוּלָ֣ה\rb* \rb with oil|בַשָּׁ֑מֶן\rb* \rb with each|הָֽאֶחָ֗ד\rb* \rb of the thirteen|לִשְׁלֹשָׁ֤ה\rb*\rb |עָשָׂר֙\rb*\rb |פָּרִ֔ים\rb* \rb bulls,|לַפָּ֣ר\rb* \rb two-tenths of an ephah|שְׁנֵ֤י\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרֹנִים֙\rb* \rb with each|הָֽאֶחָ֔ד\rb* \rb of the two|לִשְׁנֵ֖י\rb*\rb |הָאֵילִֽם׃\rb* \rb rams,|לָאַ֣יִל\rb* \v 15 \rb and a tenth of an ephah|וְעִשָּׂרׄוֹן֙\rb*\rb |עִשָּׂר֔וֹן\rb* \rb with each|הָאֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb of the fourteen|לְאַרְבָּעָ֥ה\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֖ר\rb*\rb |כְּבָשִֽׂים׃\rb* \rb lambs.|לַכֶּ֖בֶשׂ\rb* \v 16 \rb Include one|אֶחָ֖ד\rb* \rb male goat|וּשְׂעִיר־\rb*\rb |עִזִּ֥ים\rb* \rb as a sin offering,|חַטָּ֑את\rb* \rb in addition to|מִלְּבַד֙\rb* \rb the regular|הַתָּמִ֔יד\rb* \rb burnt offering|עֹלַ֣ת\rb* \rb with its grain offering|מִנְחָתָ֖הּ\rb* \rb and drink offering.|וְנִסְכָּֽהּ׃ס\rb*
\p \v 17 \rb On the second|הַשֵּׁנִ֗י\rb* \rb day|וּבַיּ֣וֹם\rb* \rb you are to present twelve|שְׁנֵ֥ים\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֖ר\rb* \rb young bulls,|פָּרִ֧ים\rb* \rb two|שְׁנָ֑יִם\rb* \rb rams,|אֵילִ֣ם\rb* \rb and fourteen|אַרְבָּעָ֥ה\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֖ר\rb* \rb male lambs|כְּבָשִׂ֧ים\rb*\rb |בְּנֵי־\rb*\rb |בְּנֵי־\rb*\rb |בָקָ֛ר\rb* \rb a year old,|שָׁנָ֛ה\rb* \rb all unblemished,|תְּמִימִֽם׃\rb* \v 18 \rb along with the grain and drink offerings|וּמִנְחָתָ֣ם\rb*\rb |וְנִסְכֵּיהֶ֡ם\rb* \rb for the bulls,|לַ֠פָּרִים\rb* \rb rams,|לָאֵילִ֧ם\rb* \rb and lambs,|וְלַכְּבָשִׂ֛ים\rb* \rb according to the number|בְּמִסְפָּרָ֖ם\rb* \rb prescribed.|כַּמִּשְׁפָּֽט׃\rb* \v 19 \rb Include one|אֶחָ֖ד\rb* \rb male goat|וּשְׂעִיר־\rb*\rb |עִזִּ֥ים\rb* \rb as a sin offering,|חַטָּ֑את\rb* \rb in addition to|מִלְּבַד֙\rb* \rb the regular|הַתָּמִ֔יד\rb* \rb burnt offering|עֹלַ֣ת\rb* \rb with its grain offering|וּמִנְחָתָ֖הּ\rb* \rb and drink offering.|וְנִסְכֵּיהֶֽם׃ס\rb*
\p \v 20 \rb On the third|הַשְּׁלִישִׁ֛י\rb* \rb day|וּבַיּ֧וֹם\rb* \rb you are to present eleven|עַשְׁתֵּי־\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֖ר\rb* \rb bulls,|פָּרִ֥ים\rb* \rb two|שְׁנָ֑יִם\rb* \rb rams,|אֵילִ֣ם\rb* \rb and fourteen|אַרְבָּעָ֥ה\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֖ר\rb* \rb male lambs|כְּבָשִׂ֧ים\rb* \rb a year old,|בְּנֵי־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֛ה\rb* \rb all unblemished,|תְּמִימִֽם׃\rb* \v 21 \rb along with the grain and drink offerings|וּמִנְחָתָ֣ם\rb*\rb |וְנִסְכֵּיהֶ֡ם\rb* \rb for the bulls,|לַ֠פָּרִים\rb* \rb rams,|לָאֵילִ֧ם\rb* \rb and lambs,|וְלַכְּבָשִׂ֛ים\rb* \rb according to the number|בְּמִסְפָּרָ֖ם\rb* \rb prescribed.|כַּמִּשְׁפָּֽט׃\rb* \v 22 \rb Include one|אֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb male goat|וּשְׂעִ֥יר\rb* \rb as a sin offering,|חַטָּ֖את\rb* \rb in addition to|מִלְּבַד֙\rb* \rb the regular|הַתָּמִ֔יד\rb* \rb burnt offering|עֹלַ֣ת\rb* \rb with its grain offering|וּמִנְחָתָ֖הּ\rb* \rb and drink offering.|וְנִסְכָּֽהּ׃ס\rb*
\p \v 23 \rb On the fourth|הָרְבִיעִ֛י\rb* \rb day|וּבַיּ֧וֹם\rb* \rb you are to present ten|עֲשָׂרָ֖ה\rb* \rb bulls,|פָּרִ֥ים\rb* \rb two|שְׁנָ֑יִם\rb* \rb rams,|אֵילִ֣ם\rb* \rb and fourteen|אַרְבָּעָ֥ה\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֖ר\rb* \rb male lambs|כְּבָשִׂ֧ים\rb* \rb a year old,|בְּנֵֽי־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֛ה\rb* \rb all unblemished,|תְּמִימִֽם׃\rb* \v 24 \rb along with the grain and drink offerings|מִנְחָתָ֣ם\rb*\rb |וְנִסְכֵּיהֶ֡ם\rb* \rb for the bulls,|לַ֠פָּרִים\rb* \rb rams,|לָאֵילִ֧ם\rb* \rb and lambs,|וְלַכְּבָשִׂ֛ים\rb* \rb according to the number|בְּמִסְפָּרָ֖ם\rb* \rb prescribed.|כַּמִּשְׁפָּֽט׃\rb* \v 25 \rb Include one|אֶחָ֖ד\rb* \rb male goat|וּשְׂעִיר־\rb*\rb |עִזִּ֥ים\rb* \rb as a sin offering,|חַטָּ֑את\rb* \rb in addition to|מִלְּבַד֙\rb* \rb the regular|הַתָּמִ֔יד\rb* \rb burnt offering|עֹלַ֣ת\rb* \rb with its grain offering|מִנְחָתָ֖הּ\rb* \rb and drink offering.|וְנִסְכָּֽהּ׃ס\rb*
\p \v 26 \rb On the fifth|הַחֲמִישִׁ֛י\rb* \rb day|וּבַיּ֧וֹם\rb* \rb you are to present nine|תִּשְׁעָ֖ה\rb* \rb bulls,|פָּרִ֥ים\rb* \rb two|שְׁנָ֑יִם\rb* \rb rams,|אֵילִ֣ם\rb* \rb and fourteen|אַרְבָּעָ֥ה\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֖ר\rb* \rb male lambs|כְּבָשִׂ֧ים\rb* \rb a year old,|בְּנֵֽי־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֛ה\rb* \rb all unblemished,|תְּמִימִֽם׃\rb* \v 27 \rb along with the grain and drink offerings|וּמִנְחָתָ֣ם\rb*\rb |וְנִסְכֵּיהֶ֡ם\rb* \rb for the bulls,|לַ֠פָּרִים\rb* \rb rams,|לָאֵילִ֧ם\rb* \rb and lambs,|וְלַכְּבָשִׂ֛ים\rb* \rb according to the number|בְּמִסְפָּרָ֖ם\rb* \rb prescribed.|כַּמִּשְׁפָּֽט׃\rb* \v 28 \rb Include one|אֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb male goat|וּשְׂעִ֥יר\rb* \rb as a sin offering,|חַטָּ֖את\rb* \rb in addition to|מִלְּבַד֙\rb* \rb the regular|הַתָּמִ֔יד\rb* \rb burnt offering|עֹלַ֣ת\rb* \rb with its grain offering|וּמִנְחָתָ֖הּ\rb* \rb and drink offering.|וְנִסְכָּֽהּ׃ס\rb*
\p \v 29 \rb On the sixth|הַשִּׁשִּׁ֛י\rb* \rb day|וּבַיּ֧וֹם\rb* \rb you are to present eight|שְׁמֹנָ֖ה\rb* \rb bulls,|פָּרִ֥ים\rb* \rb two|שְׁנָ֑יִם\rb* \rb rams,|אֵילִ֣ם\rb* \rb and fourteen|אַרְבָּעָ֥ה\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֖ר\rb* \rb male lambs|כְּבָשִׂ֧ים\rb* \rb a year old,|בְּנֵי־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֛ה\rb* \rb all unblemished,|תְּמִימִֽם׃\rb* \v 30 \rb along with the grain and drink offerings|וּמִנְחָתָ֣ם\rb*\rb |וְנִסְכֵּיהֶ֡ם\rb* \rb for the bulls,|לַ֠פָּרִים\rb* \rb rams,|לָאֵילִ֧ם\rb* \rb and lambs,|וְלַכְּבָשִׂ֛ים\rb* \rb according to the number|בְּמִסְפָּרָ֖ם\rb* \rb prescribed.|כַּמִּשְׁפָּֽט׃\rb* \v 31 \rb Include one|אֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb male goat|וּשְׂעִ֥יר\rb* \rb as a sin offering,|חַטָּ֖את\rb* \rb in addition to|מִלְּבַד֙\rb* \rb the regular|הַתָּמִ֔יד\rb* \rb burnt offering|עֹלַ֣ת\rb* \rb with its grain offering|מִנְחָתָ֖הּ\rb* \rb and drink offering.|וּנְסָכֶֽיהָ׃פ\rb*
\p \v 32 \rb On the seventh|הַשְּׁבִיעִ֛י\rb* \rb day|וּבַיּ֧וֹם\rb* \rb you are to present seven|שִׁבְעָ֖ה\rb* \rb bulls,|פָּרִ֥ים\rb* \rb two|שְׁנָ֑יִם\rb* \rb rams,|אֵילִ֣ם\rb* \rb and fourteen|אַרְבָּעָ֥ה\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֖ר\rb* \rb male lambs|כְּבָשִׂ֧ים\rb* \rb a year old,|בְּנֵי־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֛ה\rb* \rb all unblemished,|תְּמִימִֽם׃\rb* \v 33 \rb along with the grain and drink offerings|וּמִנְחָתָ֣ם\rb*\rb |וְנִסְכֵּהֶ֡ם\rb* \rb for the bulls,|לַ֠פָּרִים\rb* \rb rams,|לָאֵילִ֧ם\rb* \rb and lambs,|וְלַכְּבָשִׂ֛ים\rb* \rb according to the number|בְּמִסְפָּרָ֖ם\rb* \rb prescribed.|כְּמִשְׁפָּטָֽם׃\rb* \v 34 \rb Include one|אֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb male goat|וּשְׂעִ֥יר\rb* \rb as a sin offering,|חַטָּ֖את\rb* \rb in addition to|מִלְּבַד֙\rb* \rb the regular|הַתָּמִ֔יד\rb* \rb burnt offering|עֹלַ֣ת\rb* \rb with its grain offering|מִנְחָתָ֖הּ\rb* \rb and drink offering.|וְנִסְכָּֽהּ׃פ\rb*
\p \v 35 \rb On the eighth|הַשְּׁמִינִ֔י\rb* \rb day|בַּיּוֹם֙\rb* \rb you are to hold|תִּהְיֶ֣ה\rb* \rb a solemn assembly;|עֲצֶ֖רֶת\rb* \rb you must not|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb do|תַעֲשֽׂוּ׃\rb* \rb any|כָּל־\rb* \rb regular work.|מְלֶ֥אכֶת\rb*\rb |עֲבֹדָ֖ה\rb* \v 36 \rb As a pleasing|נִיחֹ֙חַ֙\rb* \rb aroma|רֵ֤יחַ\rb* \rb to the LORD,|לַֽיהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb you are to present|וְהִקְרַבְתֶּ֨ם\rb* \rb a food offering,|אִשֵּׁ֨ה\rb* \rb a burnt offering|עֹלָ֜ה\rb* \rb of one|אֶחָ֖ד\rb* \rb bull,|פַּ֥ר\rb* \rb one|אֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb ram,|אַ֣יִל\rb* \rb and seven|שִׁבְעָ֖ה\rb* \rb male lambs|כְּבָשִׂ֧ים\rb* \rb a year old,|בְּנֵי־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָ֛ה\rb* \rb all unblemished,|תְּמִימִֽם׃\rb* \v 37 \rb along with the grain and drink offerings|מִנְחָתָ֣ם\rb*\rb |וְנִסְכֵּיהֶ֗ם\rb* \rb for the bulls,|לַפָּ֨ר\rb* \rb rams,|לָאַ֧יִל\rb* \rb and lambs,|וְלַכְּבָשִׂ֛ים\rb* \rb according to the number|בְּמִסְפָּרָ֖ם\rb* \rb prescribed.|כַּמִּשְׁפָּֽט׃\rb* \v 38 \rb Include one|אֶחָ֑ד\rb* \rb male goat|וּשְׂעִ֥יר\rb* \rb as a sin offering,|חַטָּ֖את\rb* \rb in addition to|מִלְּבַד֙\rb* \rb the regular|הַתָּמִ֔יד\rb* \rb burnt offering|עֹלַ֣ת\rb* \rb with its grain offering|וּמִנְחָתָ֖הּ\rb* \rb and drink offering.|וְנִסְכָּֽהּ׃\rb*
\p \v 39 \rb You are to present|תַּעֲשׂ֥וּ\rb* \rb these offerings|אֵ֛לֶּה\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַיהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb at your appointed times,|בְּמוֹעֲדֵיכֶ֑ם\rb* \rb in addition to|לְבַ֨ד\rb* \rb your vow|מִנִּדְרֵיכֶ֜ם\rb* \rb and freewill offerings,|וְנִדְבֹתֵיכֶ֗ם\rb* \rb whether burnt offerings,|לְעֹלֹֽתֵיכֶם֙\rb* \rb grain offerings,|וּלְמִנְחֹ֣תֵיכֶ֔ם\rb* \rb drink offerings,|וּלְנִסְכֵּיכֶ֖ם\rb* \rb or peace offerings.”|וּלְשַׁלְמֵיכֶֽם׃\rb*
\p \v 40 \rb So Moses|מֹשֶׁ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb spoke|וַיֹּ֥אמֶר\rb* \rb all this|כְּכֹ֛ל\rb* \rb to the Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb* \rb just as|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb had commanded|צִוָּ֥ה\rb* \rb him.|מֹשֶֽׁה׃פ\rb*
\c 30
\s1 Laws about Vows
\r \ref Matthew 5:33–37|MAT 5:33-37\ref*)
\p \v 1 \rb Then Moses|מֹשֶׁה֙\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb said|וַיְדַבֵּ֤ר\rb* \rb to the heads|רָאשֵׁ֣י\rb* \rb of the tribes|הַמַּטּ֔וֹת\rb*\rb |לִבְנֵ֥י\rb* \rb of Israel,|יִשְׂרָאֵ֖ל\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹ֑ר\rb* \rb “This|זֶ֣ה\rb*\rb |הַדָּבָ֔ר\rb* \rb is what|אֲשֶׁ֖ר\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָֽה׃\rb* \rb has commanded:|צִוָּ֥ה\rb* \v 2 \rb If|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb a man|אִישׁ֩\rb* \rb makes|יִדֹּ֨ר\rb* \rb a vow|נֶ֜דֶר\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַֽיהוָ֗ה\rb* \rb or|אֽוֹ־\rb* \rb swears|הִשָּׁ֤בַע\rb* \rb an oath|שְׁבֻעָה֙\rb* \rb to obligate|לֶאְסֹ֤ר\rb* \rb himself|נַפְשׁ֔וֹ\rb*\rb |עַל־\rb* \rb by a pledge,|אִסָּר֙\rb* \rb he must not|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb break|יַחֵ֖ל\rb* \rb his word;|דְּבָר֑וֹ\rb* \rb he must do|יַעֲשֶֽׂה׃\rb* \rb everything|כְּכָל־\rb* \rb he has promised.|הַיֹּצֵ֥א\rb*\f + \fr 30:2 \ft Cited in \ref Matthew 5:33|MAT 5:33\ref*\f*\rb |מִפִּ֖יו\rb*
\p \v 3 \rb And if|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb a woman|וְאִשָּׁ֕ה\rb* \rb in her father’s|אָבִ֖יהָ\rb* \rb house|בְּבֵ֥ית\rb* \rb during her youth|בִּנְעֻרֶֽיהָ׃\rb* \rb makes|תִדֹּ֥ר\rb* \rb a vow|נֶ֖דֶר\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַיהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb or obligates herself|וְאָסְרָ֥ה\rb* \rb by a pledge,|אִסָּ֛ר\rb* \v 4 \rb and her father|אָבִ֜יהָ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb hears about|וְשָׁמַ֨ע\rb* \rb her vow|נִדְרָ֗הּ\rb* \rb or pledge|וֶֽאֱסָרָהּ֙\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb*\rb |אָֽסְרָ֣ה\rb*\rb |נַפְשָׁ֔הּ\rb*\rb |עַל־\rb* \rb but|אָבִ֑יהָ\rb* \rb says nothing|וְהֶחֱרִ֥ישׁ\rb* \rb to her,|לָ֖הּ\rb* \rb then all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the vows|נְדָרֶ֔יהָ\rb* \rb or|וְכָל־\rb* \rb pledges|אִסָּ֛ר\rb* \rb by which|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb she has bound|אָסְרָ֥ה\rb* \rb herself|נַפְשָׁ֖הּ\rb*\rb |יָקֽוּם׃\rb*\rb |עַל־\rb* \rb shall stand.|וְקָ֙מוּ֙\rb* \v 5 \rb But if|וְאִם־\rb* \rb her father|אָבִ֣יהָ\rb*\rb |אֹתָהּ֮\rb* \rb prohibits her|הֵנִ֨יא\rb* \rb on the day|בְּי֣וֹם\rb* \rb he hears|שָׁמְעוֹ֒\rb* \rb about it,|כָּל־\rb* \rb then none|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb of the vows|נְדָרֶ֗יהָ\rb* \rb or pledges|וֶֽאֱסָרֶ֛יהָ\rb* \rb by which|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb she has bound|אָסְרָ֥ה\rb* \rb herself|נַפְשָׁ֖הּ\rb*\rb |עַל־\rb* \rb shall stand.|יָק֑וּם\rb* \rb The LORD|וַֽיהוָה֙\rb* \rb will absolve|יִֽסְלַח־\rb* \rb her|לָ֔הּ\rb* \rb because|כִּי־\rb* \rb her father|אָבִ֖יהָ\rb*\rb |אֹתָֽהּ׃\rb* \rb has prohibited her.|הֵנִ֥יא\rb*
\p \v 6 \rb If|וְאִם־\rb* \rb a woman marries|הָי֤וֹ\rb*\rb |תִֽהְיֶה֙\rb*\rb |לְאִ֔ישׁ\rb* \rb while under a vow|וּנְדָרֶ֖יהָ\rb*\rb |עָלֶ֑יהָ\rb* \rb or|א֚וֹ\rb* \rb rash promise|מִבְטָ֣א\rb*\rb |שְׂפָתֶ֔יהָ\rb* \rb by which|אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb she|נַפְשָֽׁהּ׃\rb* \rb has bound|אָסְרָ֖ה\rb* \rb herself,|עַל־\rb* \v 7 \rb and her husband|אִישָׁ֛הּ\rb* \rb hears of it|וְשָׁמַ֥ע\rb* \rb but says nothing|וְהֶחֱרִ֣ישׁ\rb* \rb to her|לָ֑הּ\rb* \rb on that day,|בְּי֥וֹם\rb*\rb |שָׁמְע֖וֹ\rb* \rb then the vows|נְדָרֶ֗יהָ\rb*\rb |וְקָ֣מוּ\rb* \rb or pledges|וֶֽאֱסָרֶ֛הָ\rb* \rb by which|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb she|נַפְשָׁ֖הּ\rb* \rb has bound|אָסְרָ֥ה\rb* \rb herself|עַל־\rb* \rb shall stand.|יָקֻֽמוּ׃\rb* \v 8 \rb But if|וְ֠אִם\rb* \rb her husband|אִישָׁהּ֮\rb* \rb prohibits|יָנִ֣יא\rb* \rb her|אוֹתָהּ֒\rb* \rb when|בְּי֨וֹם\rb* \rb he hears of it,|שְׁמֹ֣עַ\rb* \rb he nullifies|וְהֵפֵ֗ר\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the vow|נִדְרָהּ֙\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb binds her|עָלֶ֔יהָ\rb*\rb |וְאֵת֙\rb* \rb or the rash promise|מִבְטָ֣א\rb*\rb |שְׂפָתֶ֔יהָ\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb she|נַפְשָׁ֑הּ\rb* \rb has made,|אָסְרָ֖ה\rb*\rb |עַל־\rb* \rb and the LORD|וַיהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb will absolve|יִֽסְלַֽח־\rb* \rb her.|לָֽהּ׃\rb*
\p \v 9 \rb Every|כֹּ֛ל\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb vow|וְנֵ֥דֶר\rb* \rb a widow|אַלְמָנָ֖ה\rb* \rb or divorced woman|וּגְרוּשָׁ֑ה\rb* \rb pledges to fulfill|אָסְרָ֥ה\rb*\rb |עַל־\rb*\rb |נַפְשָׁ֖הּ\rb* \rb is binding|יָק֥וּם\rb* \rb on her.|עָלֶֽיהָ׃\rb*
\p \v 10 \rb If|וְאִם־\rb* \rb a woman in her husband’s|אִישָׁ֖הּ\rb* \rb house|בֵּ֥ית\rb* \rb has made a vow|נָדָ֑רָה\rb* \rb or|אֽוֹ־\rb* \rb put herself|נַפְשָׁ֖הּ\rb* \rb under|עַל־\rb* \rb an obligation|אָסְרָ֥ה\rb*\rb |אִסָּ֛ר\rb* \rb with an oath,|בִּשְׁבֻעָֽה׃\rb* \v 11 \rb and her husband|אִישָׁהּ֙\rb* \rb hears of it|וְשָׁמַ֤ע\rb* \rb but says nothing|וְהֶחֱרִ֣שׁ\rb* \rb to her|לָ֔הּ\rb* \rb and does not|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb prohibit her,|הֵנִ֖יא\rb*\rb |אֹתָ֑הּ\rb* \rb then all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the vows|נְדָרֶ֔יהָ\rb*\rb |וְקָ֙מוּ֙\rb* \rb or|וְכָל־\rb* \rb pledges|אִסָּ֛ר\rb* \rb by which|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb she has bound|אָסְרָ֥ה\rb* \rb herself|נַפְשָׁ֖הּ\rb*\rb |עַל־\rb* \rb shall stand.|יָקֽוּם׃\rb* \v 12 \rb But if|וְאִם־\rb* \rb her husband|אִישָׁהּ֮\rb* \rb nullifies them|הָפֵר֩\rb* \rb on the day|בְּי֣וֹם\rb* \rb he hears of them,|שָׁמְעוֹ֒\rb* \rb then nothing|כָּל־\rb*\rb |לֹ֣א\rb* \rb that came from|מוֹצָ֨א\rb* \rb her lips,|שְׂפָתֶ֧יהָ\rb* \rb whether her vows|לִנְדָרֶ֛יהָ\rb*\rb |נַפְשָׁ֖הּ\rb* \rb or pledges,|וּלְאִסַּ֥ר\rb* \rb shall stand.|יָק֑וּם\rb* \rb Her husband|אִישָׁ֣הּ\rb*\rb |הֲפֵרָ֔ם\rb* \rb has nullified them,|יָפֵ֨ר\rb*\rb |אֹתָ֥ם׀\rb* \rb and the LORD|וַיהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb will absolve|יִֽסְלַֽח־\rb* \rb her.|לָֽהּ׃\rb*
\p \v 13 \rb Her husband|אִישָׁ֥הּ\rb* \rb may confirm|יְקִימֶ֖נּוּ\rb*\rb |וְאִישָׁ֥הּ\rb* \rb or nullify|יְפֵרֶֽנּוּ׃\rb* \rb any|כָּל־\rb* \rb vow|נֵ֛דֶר\rb* \rb or any|וְכָל־\rb* \rb sworn|שְׁבֻעַ֥ת\rb* \rb pledge|אִסָּ֖ר\rb* \rb to deny|לְעַנֹּ֣ת\rb* \rb herself.|נָ֑פֶשׁ\rb*\f + \fr 30:13 \ft Or \fqa to fast\f* \v 14 \rb But if|וְאִם־\rb* \rb her husband|אִישָׁהּ֮\rb* \rb says nothing|הַחֲרֵשׁ֩\rb*\rb |יַחֲרִ֨ישׁ\rb* \rb to her|לָ֥הּ\rb* \rb from day|מִיּ֣וֹם\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb day,|יוֹם֒\rb* \rb then he confirms|וְהֵקִים֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the vows|נְדָרֶ֔יהָ\rb* \rb and|א֥וֹ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb*\rb |כָּל־\rb* \rb pledges|אֱסָרֶ֖יהָ\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb bind her.|עָלֶ֑יהָ\rb* \rb He has confirmed|הֵקִ֣ים\rb* \rb them,|אֹתָ֔ם\rb* \rb because|כִּי־\rb* \rb he said nothing|הֶחֱרִ֥שׁ\rb* \rb to her|לָ֖הּ\rb* \rb on the day|בְּי֥וֹם\rb* \rb he heard about them.|שָׁמְעֽוֹ׃\rb* \v 15 \rb But if|וְאִם־\rb* \rb he nullifies|הָפֵ֥ר\rb*\rb |יָפֵ֛ר\rb* \rb them|אֹתָ֖ם\rb* \rb after|אַחֲרֵ֣י\rb* \rb he hears of them,|שָׁמְע֑וֹ\rb* \rb then he will bear|וְנָשָׂ֖א\rb* \rb her|אֶת־\rb* \rb iniquity.”|עֲוֺנָֽהּ׃\rb*
\p \v 16 \rb These|אֵ֣לֶּה\rb* \rb are the statutes|הַֽחֻקִּ֗ים\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָה֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb commanded|צִוָּ֤ה\rb* \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁ֔ה\rb* \rb concerning the relationship between|בֵּ֥ין\rb* \rb a man|אִ֖ישׁ\rb* \rb and his wife,|לְאִשְׁתּ֑וֹ\rb* \rb and between|בֵּֽין־\rb* \rb a father|אָ֣ב\rb* \rb and a young daughter|לְבִתּ֔וֹ\rb*\rb |בִּנְעֻרֶ֖יהָ\rb* \rb still in his|אָבִֽיהָ׃פ\rb* \rb home.|בֵּ֥ית\rb*
\c 31
\s1 Vengeance on Midian
\p \v 1 \rb And the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb said|וַיְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |לֵּאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 2 \rb “Take vengeance|נְקֹ֗ם\rb*\rb |נִקְמַת֙\rb* \rb on|מֵאֵ֖ת\rb* \rb the Midianites|הַמִּדְיָנִ֑ים\rb* \rb for the Israelites.|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb After that,|אַחַ֖ר\rb* \rb you will be gathered|תֵּאָסֵ֥ף\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb your people.”|עַמֶּֽיךָ׃\rb*
\p \v 3 \rb So Moses|מֹשֶׁה֙\rb* \rb told|וַיְדַבֵּ֤ר\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb the people,|הָעָ֣ם\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹ֔ר\rb* \rb “Arm|הֵחָלְצ֧וּ\rb*\rb |מֵאִתְּכֶ֛ם\rb* \rb some of your men|אֲנָשִׁ֖ים\rb* \rb for war,|לַצָּבָ֑א\rb* \rb that they may go|וְיִהְיוּ֙\rb* \rb against|עַל־\rb* \rb the Midianites|מִדְיָ֔ן\rb* \rb and execute|לָתֵ֥ת\rb* \rb the LORD’s|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb vengeance|נִקְמַת־\rb* \rb on them.|בְּמִדְיָֽן׃\rb* \v 4 \rb Send|תִּשְׁלְח֖וּ\rb* \rb into battle|לַצָּבָֽא׃\rb* \rb a thousand men|אֶ֚לֶף\rb* \rb from each|לְכֹל֙\rb* \rb tribe|מַטּ֣וֹת\rb* \rb of Israel.”|יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb*\rb |לַמַּטֶּ֔ה\rb*\rb |אֶ֖לֶף\rb*\rb |לַמַּטֶּ֑ה\rb*
\p \v 5 \rb So a thousand men|מֵאַלְפֵ֣י\rb* \rb were recruited|וַיִּמָּֽסְרוּ֙\rb* \rb from each tribe|לַמַּטֶּ֑ה\rb*\rb |אֶ֖לֶף\rb* \rb of Israel—|יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb twelve|שְׁנֵים־\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֥ר\rb* \rb thousand|אֶ֖לֶף\rb* \rb armed|חֲלוּצֵ֥י\rb* \rb for war.|צָבָֽא׃\rb* \v 6 \rb And Moses|מֹשֶׁ֛ה\rb* \rb sent|וַיִּשְׁלַ֨ח\rb*\rb |אֹתָ֥ם\rb* \rb the thousand|אֶ֥לֶף\rb* \rb from each tribe|לַמַּטֶּ֖ה\rb* \rb into battle,|לַצָּבָ֑א\rb*\rb |אֹ֠תָם\rb* \rb along with|וְאֶת־\rb* \rb Phinehas|פִּ֨ינְחָ֜ס\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Eleazar|אֶלְעָזָ֤ר\rb* \rb the priest,|הַכֹּהֵן֙\rb*\rb |לַצָּבָ֔א\rb* \rb who took with him|בְּיָדֽוֹ׃\rb* \rb the vessels|וּכְלֵ֥י\rb* \rb of the sanctuary|הַקֹּ֛דֶשׁ\rb* \rb and the trumpets|וַחֲצֹצְר֥וֹת\rb* \rb for signaling.|הַתְּרוּעָ֖ה\rb*
\p \v 7 \rb Then they waged war|וַֽיִּצְבְּאוּ֙\rb* \rb against|עַל־\rb* \rb Midian,|מִדְיָ֔ן\rb* \rb as|כַּאֲשֶׁ֛ר\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb had commanded|צִוָּ֥ה\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֑ה\rb* \rb and they killed|וַיַּֽהַרְג֖וּ\rb* \rb every|כָּל־\rb* \rb male.|זָכָֽר׃\rb* \v 8 \rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb Among|עַל־\rb* \rb the slain|חַלְלֵיהֶ֗ם\rb* \rb were|הָרְג֣וּ\rb*\rb |מַלְכֵ֨י\rb*\rb |מִדְיָ֜ן\rb* \rb Evi,|אֱוִ֤י\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb Rekem,|רֶ֙קֶם֙\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb Zur,|צ֤וּר\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb Hur,|חוּר֙\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb and Reba—|רֶ֔בַע\rb* \rb the five|חֲמֵ֖שֶׁת\rb* \rb kings|מַלְכֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Midian.|מִדְיָ֑ן\rb*\rb |וְאֵת֙\rb* \rb They also killed|הָרְג֖וּ\rb* \rb Balaam|בִּלְעָ֣ם\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Beor|בְּע֔וֹר\rb* \rb with the sword.|בֶּחָֽרֶב׃\rb*
\p \v 9 \rb The Israelites|בְנֵי־\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֛ל\rb* \rb captured|וַיִּשְׁבּ֧וּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the Midianite|מִדְיָ֖ן\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb women|נְשֵׁ֥י\rb* \rb and their children,|טַפָּ֑ם\rb*\rb |וְאֵ֨ת\rb* \rb and they plundered|בָּזָֽזוּ׃\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb their herds,|בְּהֶמְתָּ֧ם\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb*\rb |כָּל־\rb* \rb flocks,|מִקְנֵהֶ֛ם\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb*\rb |כָּל־\rb* \rb and goods.|חֵילָ֖ם\rb* \v 10 \rb Then|וְאֵ֤ת\rb* \rb they burned|שָׂרְפ֖וּ\rb*\rb |בָּאֵֽשׁ׃\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the cities|עָרֵיהֶם֙\rb* \rb where the Midianites had lived,|בְּמ֣וֹשְׁבֹתָ֔ם\rb*\rb |וְאֵ֖ת\rb* \rb as well as all|כָּל־\rb* \rb their encampments,|טִֽירֹתָ֑ם\rb* \v 11 \rb and carried away|וַיִּקְחוּ֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the plunder|הַשָּׁלָ֔ל\rb*\rb |וְאֵ֖ת\rb* \rb and|כָּל־\rb* \rb spoils,|הַמַּלְק֑וֹחַ\rb* \rb both people|בָּאָדָ֖ם\rb* \rb and animals.|וּבַבְּהֵמָֽה׃\rb*
\p \v 12 \rb They brought|וַיָּבִ֡אוּ\rb* \rb the captives,|הַשְּׁבִ֧י\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb spoils,|הַמַּלְק֛וֹחַ\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb and plunder|הַשָּׁלָ֖ל\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁה֩\rb* \rb to|וְאֶל־\rb* \rb Eleazar|אֶלְעָזָ֨ר\rb* \rb the priest,|הַכֹּהֵ֜ן\rb* \rb and to|וְאֶל־\rb* \rb the congregation|עֲדַ֣ת\rb*\rb |בְּנֵֽי־\rb* \rb of Israel|יִשְׂרָאֵ֗ל\rb* \rb at|אֶל־\rb* \rb the camp|הַֽמַּחֲנֶ֑ה\rb* \rb on|אֶל־\rb* \rb the plains|עַֽרְבֹ֣ת\rb* \rb of Moab,|מוֹאָ֔ב\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֖ר\rb* \rb by|עַל־\rb* \rb the Jordan|יַרְדֵּ֥ן\rb* \rb across from Jericho.|יְרֵחֽוֹ׃ס\rb* \v 13 \rb And Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֨ה\rb* \rb Eleazar|וְאֶלְעָזָ֧ר\rb* \rb the priest,|הַכֹּהֵ֛ן\rb* \rb and all|וְכָל־\rb* \rb the leaders|נְשִׂיאֵ֥י\rb* \rb of the congregation|הָעֵדָ֖ה\rb* \rb went|וַיֵּ֨צְא֜וּ\rb* \rb to meet them|לִקְרָאתָ֑ם\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb outside|מִח֖וּץ\rb* \rb the camp.|לַֽמַּחֲנֶֽה׃\rb*
\p \v 14 \rb But Moses|מֹשֶׁ֔ה\rb* \rb was angry|וַיִּקְצֹ֣ף\rb* \rb with|עַ֖ל\rb* \rb the officers|פְּקוּדֵ֣י\rb* \rb of the army—|הֶחָ֑יִל\rb*  \rb the commanders|שָׂרֵ֤י\rb* \rb of thousands|הָאֲלָפִים֙\rb* \rb and commanders|וְשָׂרֵ֣י\rb* \rb of hundreds—|הַמֵּא֔וֹת\rb*  \rb who were returning|הַבָּאִ֖ים\rb* \rb from|מִצְּבָ֥א\rb* \rb the battle.|הַמִּלְחָמָֽה׃\rb* \v 15 \rb “Have you spared|הַֽחִיִּיתֶ֖ם\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the women?”|נְקֵבָֽה׃\rb* \rb he|מֹשֶׁ֑ה\rb* \rb asked them.|וַיֹּ֥אמֶר\rb*\rb |אֲלֵיהֶ֖ם\rb* \v 16 \rb “Look,|הֵ֣ן\rb* \rb these women|הֵ֜נָּה\rb* \rb caused|הָי֨וּ\rb* \rb the sons|לִבְנֵ֤י\rb* \rb of Israel,|יִשְׂרָאֵל֙\rb* \rb through the counsel|בִּדְבַ֣ר\rb* \rb of Balaam,|בִּלְעָ֔ם\rb* \rb to turn|לִמְסָר־\rb* \rb unfaithfully|מַ֥עַל\rb* \rb against the LORD|בַּיהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb at|עַל־\rb* \rb Peor,|פְּע֑וֹר\rb*\rb |דְּבַר־\rb* \rb so that the plague|הַמַּגֵּפָ֖ה\rb* \rb struck|וַתְּהִ֥י\rb* \rb the congregation|בַּעֲדַ֥ת\rb* \rb of the LORD.|יְהוָֽה׃\rb* \v 17 \rb So now,|וְעַתָּ֕ה\rb* \rb kill|הִרְג֥וּ\rb* \rb all|כָל־\rb* \rb the boys,|זָכָ֖ר\rb*\rb |בַּטָּ֑ף\rb* \rb as well as|הֲרֹֽגוּ׃\rb* \rb every|וְכָל־\rb* \rb woman|אִשָּׁ֗ה\rb* \rb who has had relations with|יֹדַ֥עַת\rb*\rb |אִ֛ישׁ\rb*\rb |לְמִשְׁכַּ֥ב\rb* \rb a man,|זָכָ֖ר\rb* \v 18 \rb but spare|הַחֲי֖וּ\rb* \rb for yourselves|לָכֶֽם׃\rb* \rb every|וְכֹל֙\rb* \rb girl|הַטַּ֣ף\rb*\rb |בַּנָּשִׁ֔ים\rb* \rb who|אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb has never|לֹא־\rb* \rb had relations|יָדְע֖וּ\rb*\rb |מִשְׁכַּ֣ב\rb* \rb with a man.|זָכָ֑ר\rb*
