\p \v 48 \rb Then the officers|הַפְּקֻדִ֕ים\rb* \rb who|אֲשֶׁ֖ר\rb* \rb were over the units|לְאַלְפֵ֣י\rb* \rb of the army—|הַצָּבָ֑א\rb*  \rb the commanders|שָׂרֵ֥י\rb* \rb of thousands|הָאֲלָפִ֖ים\rb*\rb |וְשָׂרֵ֥י\rb* \rb and of hundreds—|הַמֵּאֽוֹת׃\rb*  \rb approached|וַֽיִּקְרְבוּ֙\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁ֔ה\rb* \v 49 \rb and said,|וַיֹּֽאמְרוּ֙\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb*\rb |מֹשֶׁ֔ה\rb* \rb “Your servants|עֲבָדֶ֣יךָ\rb* \rb have counted|נָֽשְׂא֗וּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb*\rb |רֹ֛אשׁ\rb* \rb the soldiers|הַמִּלְחָמָ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb*\rb |אַנְשֵׁ֥י\rb* \rb under our command,|בְּיָדֵ֑נוּ\rb* \rb and not|וְלֹא־\rb* \rb one|אִֽישׁ׃\rb* \rb of us|מִמֶּ֖נּוּ\rb* \rb is missing.|נִפְקַ֥ד\rb* \v 50 \rb So we have brought|וַנַּקְרֵ֞ב\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb to the LORD|יְהוָ֗ה\rb* \rb an offering|קָרְבַּ֣ן\rb* \rb of the gold|זָהָב֙\rb* \rb articles|כְלִֽי־\rb* \rb each man|אִישׁ֩\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb acquired—|מָצָ֤א\rb* \rb armlets,|אֶצְעָדָ֣ה\rb* \rb bracelets,|וְצָמִ֔יד\rb* \rb rings,|טַבַּ֖עַת\rb* \rb earrings,|עָגִ֣יל\rb* \rb and necklaces—|וְכוּמָ֑ז\rb* \rb to make atonement|לְכַפֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb for|עַל־\rb* \rb ourselves|נַפְשֹׁתֵ֖ינוּ\rb* \rb before|לִפְנֵ֥י\rb* \rb the LORD.”|יְהוָֽה׃\rb*
