\li1 \v 40 \rb Now the Canaanite|הַֽכְּנַעֲנִי֙\rb* \rb king|מֶ֣לֶךְ\rb* \rb of Arad,|עֲרָ֔ד\rb*\rb |וְהֽוּא־\rb* \rb who lived|יֹשֵׁ֥ב\rb* \rb in the Negev|בַּנֶּ֖גֶב\rb* \rb in the land|בְּאֶ֣רֶץ\rb* \rb of Canaan,|כְּנָ֑עַן\rb* \rb heard|וַיִּשְׁמַ֗ע\rb* \rb that the Israelites|בְּנֵ֥י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃\rb* \rb were coming.|בְּבֹ֖א\rb* \v 41 \rb And the Israelites set out|וַיִּסְע֖וּ\rb* \rb from Mount|הָהָ֑ר\rb* \rb Hor|מֵהֹ֣ר\rb* \rb and camped|וַֽיַּחֲנ֖וּ\rb* \rb at Zalmonah.|בְּצַלְמֹנָֽה׃\rb*
