\s1 Instructions for Occupying Canaan
\p \v 50 \rb On the plains|בְּעַֽרְבֹ֣ת\rb* \rb of Moab|מוֹאָ֑ב\rb* \rb by|עַל־\rb* \rb the Jordan|יַרְדֵּ֥ן\rb* \rb across from Jericho,|יְרֵח֖וֹ\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹֽר׃\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֛ה\rb* \rb said|וַיְדַבֵּ֧ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֖ה\rb* \v 51 \rb “Speak|דַּבֵּר֙\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb and tell|וְאָמַרְתָּ֖\rb* \rb them:|אֲלֵהֶ֑ם\rb* \rb When|כִּ֥י\rb* \rb you|אַתֶּ֛ם\rb* \rb cross|עֹבְרִ֥ים\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the Jordan|הַיַּרְדֵּ֖ן\rb* \rb into|אֶל־\rb* \rb the land|אֶ֥רֶץ\rb* \rb of Canaan,|כְּנָֽעַן׃\rb* \v 52 \rb you must drive out|וְה֨וֹרַשְׁתֶּ֜ם\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb before you|מִפְּנֵיכֶ֔ם\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the inhabitants|יֹשְׁבֵ֤י\rb* \rb of the land,|הָאָ֙רֶץ֙\rb* \rb destroy|וְאִ֨בַּדְתֶּ֔ם\rb*\rb |אֵ֖ת\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb their carved images|מַשְׂכִּיֹּתָ֑ם\rb*\rb |וְאֵ֨ת\rb*\rb |כָּל־\rb* \rb and cast|מַסֵּֽכֹתָם֙\rb* \rb idols,|צַלְמֵ֤י\rb*\rb |תְּאַבֵּ֔דוּ\rb* \rb and|וְאֵ֥ת\rb* \rb demolish|תַּשְׁמִֽידוּ׃\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb their high places.|בָּמֹתָ֖ם\rb*
\p \v 53 \rb You are to take possession of|וְהוֹרַשְׁתֶּ֥ם\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the land|הָאָ֖רֶץ\rb* \rb and settle|וִֽישַׁבְתֶּם־\rb* \rb in it,|בָּ֑הּ\rb* \rb for|כִּ֥י\rb* \rb I have given|נָתַ֥תִּי\rb* \rb you|לָכֶ֛ם\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the land|הָאָ֖רֶץ\rb* \rb to possess.|לָרֶ֥שֶׁת\rb*\rb |אֹתָֽהּ׃\rb* \v 54 \rb And you are to divide|וְהִתְנַחַלְתֶּם֩\rb* \rb the land|הָאָ֨רֶץ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb by lot|בְּגוֹרָ֜ל\rb* \rb according to your clans.|לְמִשְׁפְּחֹֽתֵיכֶ֗ם\rb* \rb Give a larger|תַּרְבּ֤וּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb inheritance|נַחֲלָתוֹ֙\rb* \rb to a larger clan|לָרַ֞ב\rb* \rb and a smaller|תַּמְעִ֣יט\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb inheritance|נַחֲלָת֔וֹ\rb*\rb |אֶל֩\rb* \rb to a smaller one.|וְלַמְעַט֙\rb* \rb Whatever|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb falls|יֵ֨צֵא\rb* \rb to each one|ל֥וֹ\rb* \rb by lot|הַגּוֹרָ֖ל\rb*\rb |שָׁ֛מָּה\rb* \rb will be|יִהְיֶ֑ה\rb* \rb his.|ל֣וֹ\rb* \rb You will receive an inheritance|תִּתְנֶחָֽלוּ׃\rb* \rb according to the tribes|לְמַטּ֥וֹת\rb* \rb of your fathers.|אֲבֹתֵיכֶ֖ם\rb*
\p \v 55 \rb But if|וְאִם־\rb* \rb you do not|לֹ֨א\rb* \rb drive out|תוֹרִ֜ישׁוּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the inhabitants|יֹשְׁבֵ֣י\rb* \rb of the land|הָאָרֶץ֮\rb* \rb before you,|מִפְּנֵיכֶם֒\rb* \rb those|אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb you allow to remain|תּוֹתִ֣ירוּ\rb*\rb |מֵהֶ֔ם\rb* \rb will become|וְהָיָה֙\rb* \rb barbs|לְשִׂכִּים֙\rb* \rb in your eyes|בְּעֵ֣ינֵיכֶ֔ם\rb* \rb and thorns|וְלִצְנִינִ֖ם\rb* \rb in your sides;|בְּצִדֵּיכֶ֑ם\rb* \rb they will harass|וְצָרֲר֣וּ\rb*\rb |אֶתְכֶ֔ם\rb* \rb you in|עַל־\rb* \rb the land|הָאָ֕רֶץ\rb* \rb where|אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb you|אַתֶּ֖ם\rb* \rb settle.|יֹשְׁבִ֥ים\rb* \v 56 \rb And then|וְהָיָ֗ה\rb* \rb I will do|אֶֽעֱשֶׂ֥ה\rb* \rb to you|לָכֶֽם׃פ\rb* \rb what|כַּאֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb I had planned|דִּמִּ֛יתִי\rb* \rb to do|לַעֲשׂ֥וֹת\rb* \rb to them.”|לָהֶ֖ם\rb*
\c 34
\s1 The Boundaries of Canaan
\r \ref Genesis 15:8–21|GEN 15:8-21\ref*)
\p \v 1 \rb Then the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb said|וַיְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |לֵּאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 2 \rb “Command|צַ֞ו\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְּנֵ֤י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵל֙\rb* \rb and say|וְאָמַרְתָּ֣\rb* \rb to them:|אֲלֵהֶ֔ם\rb* \rb When|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb you|אַתֶּ֥ם\rb* \rb enter|בָּאִ֖ים\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb the land|הָאָ֣רֶץ\rb* \rb of Canaan,|כְּנָ֑עַן\rb*\rb |זֹ֣את\rb* \rb it|הָאָ֗רֶץ\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb will be allotted|תִּפֹּ֤ל\rb* \rb to you|לָכֶם֙\rb* \rb as an inheritance|בְּֽנַחֲלָ֔ה\rb*\rb |אֶ֥רֶץ\rb*\rb |כְּנַ֖עַן\rb* \rb with these boundaries:|לִגְבֻלֹתֶֽיהָ׃\rb*
\li1 \v 3 \rb Your|לָכֶ֧ם\rb* \rb southern|נֶ֛גֶב\rb* \rb border|פְּאַת־\rb* \rb will extend|וְהָיָ֨ה\rb* \rb from the Wilderness|מִמִּדְבַּר־\rb* \rb of Zin|צִ֖ן\rb* \rb along|עַל־\rb* \rb the border|יְדֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Edom.|אֱד֑וֹם\rb* \rb On the east,|קֵֽדְמָה׃\rb* \rb your southern|נֶ֔גֶב\rb* \rb border|גְּב֣וּל\rb* \rb will run|וְהָיָ֤ה\rb* \rb from the end|מִקְצֵ֥ה\rb* \rb of the Salt|הַמֶּ֖לַח\rb* \rb Sea,|יָם־\rb*\f + \fr 34:3 \ft That is, the Dead Sea; also in verse 12\f* \v 4 \rb |הַגְּב֨וּל\rb* \rb cross|וְנָסַ֣ב\rb*\rb |לָכֶם֩\rb* \rb south|מִנֶּ֜גֶב\rb* \rb of the Ascent|לְמַעֲלֵ֤ה\rb* \rb of Akrabbim,|עַקְרַבִּים֙\rb*\f + \fr 34:4 \ft Or \fqa the Ascent of Scorpions \ft or \fqa Scorpion Pass\f* \rb continue|וְעָ֣בַר\rb* \rb to Zin,|צִ֔נָה\rb* \rb and go|וְהָיָה\rb*\rb |תּֽוֹצְאֹתָ֔יו\rb* \rb south|מִנֶּ֖גֶב\rb*\rb |לְקָדֵ֣שׁ\rb* \rb of Kadesh-barnea.|בַּרְנֵ֑עַ\rb* \rb Then it will go on|וְיָצָ֥א\rb*\rb |חֲצַר־\rb* \rb to Hazar-addar|אַדָּ֖ר\rb* \rb and proceed|וְעָבַ֥ר\rb* \rb to Azmon,|עַצְמֹֽנָה׃\rb* \v 5 \rb where it|הַגְּב֛וּל\rb* \rb will turn|וְנָסַ֧ב\rb* \rb from Azmon,|מֵעַצְמ֖וֹן\rb* \rb join the Brook|נַ֣חְלָה\rb* \rb of Egypt,|מִצְרָ֑יִם\rb* \rb and end|וְהָי֥וּ\rb*\rb |תוֹצְאֹתָ֖יו\rb* \rb at the Sea.|הַיָּֽמָּה׃\rb*\f + \fr 34:5 \ft That is, the Mediterranean Sea, also called the Great Sea; also in verses 6 and 7\f*
\li1 \v 6 \rb Your|לָכֶ֛ם\rb* \rb western|יָ֔ם\rb* \rb border|וּגְב֣וּל\rb* \rb will be|וְהָיָ֥ה\rb* \rb the coastline|וּגְב֑וּל\rb* \rb of the Great|הַגָּד֖וֹל\rb* \rb Sea;|הַיָּ֥ם\rb* \rb this|זֶֽה־\rb* \rb will be|יִהְיֶ֥ה\rb* \rb your|לָכֶ֖ם\rb* \rb boundary|גְּב֥וּל\rb* \rb on the west.|יָֽם׃\rb*
\li1 \v 7 \rb |וְזֶֽה־\rb* \rb Your|לָכֶ֖ם\rb* \rb northern|צָפ֑וֹן\rb* \rb border|גְּב֣וּל\rb* \rb will run|יִהְיֶ֥ה\rb* \rb from|מִן־\rb* \rb the Great|הַגָּדֹ֔ל\rb* \rb Sea|הַיָּם֙\rb* \rb directly|תְּתָא֥וּ\rb* \rb to Mount|הָהָֽר׃\rb* \rb Hor,|הֹ֥ר\rb* \v 8 \rb and from Mount|הָהָ֔ר\rb* \rb Hor|מֵהֹ֣ר\rb*\rb |לְבֹ֣א\rb* \rb to Lebo-hamath,|חֲמָ֑ת\rb* \rb then|הַגְּבֻ֖ל\rb* \rb extend|וְהָי֛וּ\rb*\rb |תּוֹצְאֹ֥ת\rb* \rb to Zedad,|צְדָֽדָה׃\rb* \v 9 \rb |הַגְּבֻל֙\rb* \rb continue|וְיָצָ֤א\rb* \rb to Ziphron,|זִפְרֹ֔נָה\rb* \rb and end|וְהָי֥וּ\rb*\rb |תוֹצְאֹתָ֖יו\rb*\rb |חֲצַ֣ר\rb* \rb at Hazar-enan.|עֵינָ֑ן\rb* \rb This|זֶֽה־\rb* \rb will be|יִהְיֶ֥ה\rb* \rb your|לָכֶ֖ם\rb* \rb boundary|גְּב֥וּל\rb* \rb on the north.|צָפֽוֹן׃\rb*
\li1 \v 10 \rb And your eastern|קֵ֑דְמָה\rb* \rb border|לִגְב֣וּל\rb* \rb will run straight|וְהִתְאַוִּיתֶ֥ם\rb* \rb from|לָכֶ֖ם\rb* \rb Hazar-enan|עֵינָ֖ן\rb* \rb to Shepham,|שְׁפָֽמָה׃\rb* \v 11 \rb then|הַגְּבֻ֧ל\rb* \rb go down|וְיָרַ֨ד\rb* \rb from Shepham|מִשְּׁפָ֛ם\rb* \rb to Riblah|הָרִבְלָ֖ה\rb* \rb on the east side|מִקֶּ֣דֶם\rb* \rb of Ain|לָעָ֑יִן\rb*\rb |הַגְּב֔וּל\rb* \rb and continue along|וְיָרַ֣ד\rb*\rb |וּמָחָ֛ה\rb*\rb |עַל־\rb* \rb the slopes|כֶּ֥תֶף\rb* \rb east|קֵֽדְמָה׃\rb* \rb of the Sea|יָם־\rb* \rb of Chinnereth.|כִּנֶּ֖רֶת\rb*\f + \fr 34:11 \ft That is, the Sea of Galilee\f* \v 12 \rb Then the border|הַגְּבוּל֙\rb* \rb will go down|וְיָרַ֤ד\rb* \rb along the Jordan|הַיַּרְדֵּ֔נָה\rb* \rb and end|וְהָי֥וּ\rb*\rb |תוֹצְאֹתָ֖יו\rb* \rb at the Salt|הַמֶּ֑לַח\rb* \rb Sea.|יָ֣ם\rb*
\p \rb This|זֹאת֩\rb* \rb will be|תִּהְיֶ֨ה\rb* \rb your|לָכֶ֥ם\rb* \rb land,|הָאָ֛רֶץ\rb* \rb defined by its borders|לִגְבֻלֹתֶ֖יהָ\rb* \rb on all sides.”|סָבִֽיב׃\rb*
\p \v 13 \rb So Moses|מֹשֶׁ֔ה\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb commanded|וַיְצַ֣ו\rb* \rb the Israelites,|בְּנֵ֥י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֖ל\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹ֑ר\rb* \rb “Apportion this|זֹ֣את\rb* \rb land|הָאָ֗רֶץ\rb* \rb by lot|בְּגוֹרָ֔ל\rb* \rb as an inheritance.|תִּתְנַחֲל֤וּ\rb*\rb |אֹתָהּ֙\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁר֙\rb* \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb has commanded that|צִוָּ֣ה\rb* \rb it be given|לָתֵ֛ת\rb* \rb to the nine|לְתִשְׁעַ֥ת\rb* \rb and a half|וַחֲצִ֥י\rb*\rb |הַמַּטֶּֽה׃\rb* \rb tribes.|הַמַּטּ֖וֹת\rb* \v 14 \rb For|כִּ֣י\rb*\rb |לָקְח֞וּ\rb* \rb the tribes|מַטֵּ֨ה\rb* \rb of the Reubenites|בְנֵ֤י\rb*\rb |הָראוּבֵנִי֙\rb*\rb |לְבֵ֣ית\rb*\rb |אֲבֹתָ֔ם\rb* \rb and|וּמַטֵּ֥ה\rb* \rb Gadites,|בְנֵֽי־\rb*\rb |הַגָּדִ֖י\rb*\rb |לְבֵ֣ית\rb*\rb |אֲבֹתָ֑ם\rb* \rb along with the half-tribe|וַחֲצִי֙\rb*\rb |מַטֵּ֣ה\rb* \rb of Manasseh,|מְנַשֶּׁ֔ה\rb* \rb have already received|לָקְח֖וּ\rb* \rb their inheritance.|נַחֲלָתָֽם׃\rb* \v 15 \rb These two|שְׁנֵ֥י\rb* \rb and a half|וַחֲצִ֣י\rb*\rb |הַמַּטֶּ֑ה\rb* \rb tribes|הַמַּטּ֖וֹת\rb* \rb have received|לָקְח֣וּ\rb* \rb their inheritance|נַחֲלָתָ֗ם\rb* \rb across|מֵעֵ֛בֶר\rb* \rb the Jordan|לְיַרְדֵּ֥ן\rb* \rb from Jericho,|יְרֵח֖וֹ\rb*\rb |קֵ֥דְמָה\rb* \rb toward the sunrise.”|מִזְרָֽחָה׃פ\rb*
\s1 Leaders to Divide the Land
