\c 35
\s1 Forty-Eight Cities for the Levites
\r \ref Joshua 21:1–45|JOS 21:1-45\ref*; \ref 1 Chronicles 6:54–81|1CH 6:54-81\ref*)
\p \v 1 \rb Again the LORD|יְהוָ֛ה\rb* \rb spoke|וַיְדַבֵּ֧ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁ֖ה\rb* \rb on the plains|בְּעַֽרְבֹ֣ת\rb* \rb of Moab|מוֹאָ֑ב\rb* \rb by|עַל־\rb* \rb the Jordan|יַרְדֵּ֥ן\rb* \rb across from Jericho:|יְרֵח֖וֹ\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 2 \rb “Command|צַו֮\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵל֒\rb* \rb to give,|וְנָתְנ֣וּ\rb* \rb from the inheritance|מִֽנַּחֲלַ֛ת\rb* \rb they will possess,|אֲחֻזָּתָ֖ם\rb* \rb cities|עָרִ֣ים\rb* \rb for the Levites|לַלְוִיִּ֗ם\rb* \rb to live in|לָשָׁ֑בֶת\rb* \rb and pasturelands|וּמִגְרָ֗שׁ\rb* \rb around|סְבִיבֹ֣תֵיהֶ֔ם\rb*\rb |תִּתְּנ֖וּ\rb*\rb |לַלְוִיִּֽם׃\rb* \rb the cities.|לֶֽעָרִים֙\rb* \v 3 \rb The cities|הֶֽעָרִ֛ים\rb* \rb will be|וְהָי֧וּ\rb* \rb for them|לָהֶ֖ם\rb* \rb to live in,|לָשָׁ֑בֶת\rb* \rb and the pasturelands|וּמִגְרְשֵׁיהֶ֗ם\rb* \rb will be|יִהְי֤וּ\rb* \rb for their herds,|לִבְהֶמְתָּם֙\rb* \rb their flocks,|וְלִרְכֻשָׁ֔ם\rb* \rb and all|וּלְכֹ֖ל\rb* \rb their other livestock.|חַיָּתָֽם׃\rb*
\p \v 4 \rb The pasturelands|וּמִגְרְשֵׁי֙\rb* \rb around the cities|הֶֽעָרִ֔ים\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb you are to give|תִּתְּנ֖וּ\rb* \rb the Levites|לַלְוִיִּ֑ם\rb*\rb |הָעִיר֙\rb* \rb will extend|וָח֔וּצָה\rb* \rb a thousand|אֶ֥לֶף\rb* \rb cubits|אַמָּ֖ה\rb*\f + \fr 35:4 \fqa 1,000 cubits \ft is approximately 1,500 feet or 457.2 meters.\f* \rb from the wall|מִקִּ֤יר\rb* \rb on every side.|סָבִֽיב׃\rb* \v 5 \rb You are also to measure|וּמַדֹּתֶ֞ם\rb* \rb two thousand|אַלְפַּ֪יִם\rb* \rb cubits|בָּֽאַמָּ֟ה\rb*\f + \fr 35:5 \fqa 2,000 cubits \ft is approximately 3,000 feet or 914.4 meters.\f*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb outside|מִח֣וּץ\rb* \rb the city|לָעִ֗יר\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb on the east,|קֵ֣דְמָה\rb*\rb |פְּאַת־\rb* \rb two thousand|אַלְפַּ֨יִם\rb*\rb |בָּאַמָּ֜ה\rb* \rb on the south,|נֶגֶב֩\rb*\rb |פְּאַת־\rb* \rb two thousand|אַלְפַּ֣יִם\rb*\rb |בָּֽאַמָּ֗ה\rb* \rb on the west,|יָ֣ם׀\rb*\rb |פְּאַת־\rb* \rb and two thousand|אַלְפַּ֥יִם\rb*\rb |בָּאַמָּ֖ה\rb* \rb on the north,|צָפ֛וֹן\rb*\rb |פְּאַ֥ת\rb* \rb with the city|וְהָעִ֣יר\rb* \rb in the center.|בַּתָּ֑וֶךְ\rb* \rb These areas|זֶ֚ה\rb* \rb will serve|יִהְיֶ֣ה\rb* \rb as larger pasturelands|מִגְרְשֵׁ֖י\rb* \rb for the cities.|הֶעָרִֽים׃\rb*
\p \v 6 \rb |וְאֵ֣ת\rb* \rb Six|שֵׁשׁ־\rb* \rb of the cities|הֶֽעָרִ֗ים\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֤ר\rb* \rb you give|תִּתְּנוּ֙\rb* \rb the Levites|לַלְוִיִּ֔ם\rb*\rb |אֵ֚ת\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb are to be appointed|תִּתְּנ֔וּ\rb* \rb as cities|עָרֵ֣י\rb* \rb of refuge,|הַמִּקְלָ֔ט\rb* \rb to which a manslayer|הָרֹצֵ֑חַ\rb* \rb may flee.|לָנֻ֥ס\rb*\rb |שָׁ֖מָּה\rb* \rb In addition to these,|וַעֲלֵיהֶ֣ם\rb* \rb give the Levites|תִּתְּנ֔וּ\rb* \rb forty-two|אַרְבָּעִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וּשְׁתַּ֖יִם\rb* \rb other cities.|עִֽיר׃\rb* \v 7 \rb The total|כָּל־\rb* \rb number of cities|הֶעָרִ֗ים\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֤ר\rb* \rb you give|תִּתְּנוּ֙\rb* \rb the Levites|לַלְוִיִּ֔ם\rb* \rb will be forty-eight,|אַרְבָּעִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וּשְׁמֹנֶ֖ה\rb*\rb |עִ֑יר\rb* \rb with their corresponding|אֶתְהֶ֖ן\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb pasturelands.|מִגְרְשֵׁיהֶֽן׃\rb* \v 8 \rb The cities|וְהֶֽעָרִ֗ים\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁ֤ר\rb* \rb you apportion|תִּתְּנוּ֙\rb*\rb |מֵאֵ֤ת\rb* \rb from the territory|מֵאֲחֻזַּ֣ת\rb*\rb |בְּנֵי־\rb* \rb of the Israelites|יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb should be given|יִתֵּ֥ן\rb*\rb |מֵעָרָ֖יו\rb* \rb to the Levites|לַלְוִיִּֽם׃פ\rb* \rb in proportion to|כְּפִ֤י\rb* \rb the inheritance|נַחֲלָתוֹ֙\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb*\rb |יִנְחָ֔לוּ\rb* \rb of each tribe:|אִ֗ישׁ\rb*\rb |וּמֵאֵ֥ת\rb* \rb more from|תַּרְבּ֔וּ\rb* \rb a larger tribe|הָרַב֙\rb* \rb and less from|תַּמְעִ֑יטוּ\rb* \rb a smaller one.”|הַמְעַ֖ט\rb*
\s1 Six Cities of Refuge
\r \ref Deuteronomy 4:41–43|DEU 4:41-43\ref*; \ref Deuteronomy 19:1–14|DEU 19:1-14\ref*; \ref Joshua 20:1–9|JOS 20:1-9\ref*)
\p \v 9 \rb Then the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb said|וַיְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |לֵּאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 10 \rb “Speak|דַּבֵּר֙\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb and tell them:|וְאָמַרְתָּ֖\rb*\rb |אֲלֵהֶ֑ם\rb* \rb When|כִּ֥י\rb* \rb you|אַתֶּ֛ם\rb* \rb cross|עֹבְרִ֥ים\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the Jordan|הַיַּרְדֵּ֖ן\rb* \rb into the land|אַ֥רְצָה\rb* \rb of Canaan,|כְּנָֽעַן׃\rb* \v 11 \rb designate|וְהִקְרִיתֶ֤ם\rb* \rb cities|עָרִ֔ים\rb* \rb to serve as|תִּהְיֶ֣ינָה\rb* \rb your|לָכֶ֑ם\rb* \rb cities|עָרֵ֥י\rb* \rb of refuge,|מִקְלָ֖ט\rb* \rb so that a person|רֹצֵ֔חַ\rb* \rb who kills|מַכֵּה־\rb* \rb someone|נֶ֖פֶשׁ\rb* \rb unintentionally|בִּשְׁגָגָֽה׃\rb* \rb may flee|וְנָ֥ס\rb* \rb there.|שָׁ֙מָּה֙\rb* \v 12 \rb You are to have|וְהָי֨וּ\rb* \rb these cities|הֶעָרִ֛ים\rb* \rb as a refuge|לְמִקְלָ֖ט\rb* \rb from the avenger,|מִגֹּאֵ֑ל\rb* \rb so that the manslayer|הָרֹצֵ֔חַ\rb* \rb will not|וְלֹ֤א\rb* \rb die|יָמוּת֙\rb* \rb until|עַד־\rb* \rb he stands|עָמְד֛וֹ\rb* \rb trial|לַמִּשְׁפָּֽט׃\rb* \rb before|לִפְנֵ֥י\rb* \rb the assembly.|הָעֵדָ֖ה\rb*
\p \v 13 \rb The cities|וְהֶעָרִ֖ים\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb you select|תִּתֵּ֑נוּ\rb* \rb will be|תִּהְיֶ֥ינָה\rb* \rb your|לָכֶֽם׃\rb* \rb six|שֵׁשׁ־\rb* \rb cities|עָרֵ֥י\rb* \rb of refuge.|מִקְלָ֖ט\rb* \v 14 \rb |אֵ֣ת׀\rb* \rb Select three|שְׁלֹ֣שׁ\rb* \rb cities|הֶעָרִ֗ים\rb*\rb |תִּתְּנוּ֙\rb* \rb across|מֵעֵ֣בֶר\rb* \rb the Jordan|לַיַּרְדֵּ֔ן\rb*\rb |וְאֵת֙\rb* \rb and three|שְׁלֹ֣שׁ\rb*\rb |הֶֽעָרִ֔ים\rb*\rb |תִּתְּנ֖וּ\rb* \rb in the land|בְּאֶ֣רֶץ\rb* \rb of Canaan|כְּנָ֑עַן\rb* \rb as|תִּהְיֶֽינָה׃\rb* \rb cities|עָרֵ֥י\rb* \rb of refuge.|מִקְלָ֖ט\rb* \v 15 \rb These|הָאֵ֖לֶּה\rb* \rb six|שֵׁשׁ־\rb* \rb cities|הֶעָרִ֥ים\rb* \rb will serve|תִּהְיֶ֛ינָה\rb* \rb as a refuge|לְמִקְלָ֑ט\rb* \rb for the Israelites|לִבְנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֗ל\rb* \rb and for the foreigner|וְלַגֵּ֤ר\rb* \rb or stranger|וְלַתּוֹשָׁב֙\rb* \rb among them,|בְּתוֹכָ֔ם\rb* \rb so that anyone|כָּל־\rb* \rb who kills|מַכֵּה־\rb* \rb a person|נֶ֖פֶשׁ\rb* \rb unintentionally|בִּשְׁגָגָֽה׃\rb* \rb may flee|לָנ֣וּס\rb* \rb there.|שָׁ֔מָּה\rb*
\p \v 16 \rb If, however,|וְאִם־\rb* \rb anyone strikes|הִכָּ֛הוּ\rb* \rb a person with an iron|בַרְזֶ֧ל׀\rb* \rb object|בִּכְלִ֨י\rb* \rb and kills him,|וַיָּמֹ֖ת\rb* \rb he|ה֑וּא\rb* \rb is a murderer;|רֹצֵ֣חַֽ\rb* \rb the murderer|הָרֹצֵֽחַ׃\rb* \rb must surely be put to death.|מ֥וֹת\rb*\rb |יוּמַ֖ת\rb* \v 17 \rb Or if|וְאִ֡ם\rb* \rb anyone has in his hand|יָד֩\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb a stone|בְּאֶ֣בֶן\rb* \rb of deadly size,|יָמ֨וּת\rb* \rb and he strikes|הִכָּ֛הוּ\rb* \rb and kills another,|וַיָּמֹ֖ת\rb* \rb he is a murderer;|רֹצֵ֣חַֽ\rb* \rb the murderer|הָרֹצֵֽחַ׃\rb*\rb |ה֑וּא\rb* \rb must surely be put to death.|מ֥וֹת\rb*\rb |יוּמַ֖ת\rb* \v 18 \rb If|א֡וֹ\rb* \rb anyone has in his hand|יָד֩\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb a deadly|יָמ֨וּת\rb* \rb object|בִּכְלִ֣י\rb* \rb of wood,|עֵֽץ־\rb* \rb and he strikes|הִכָּ֛הוּ\rb* \rb and kills another,|וַיָּמֹ֖ת\rb* \rb he is a murderer;|רֹצֵ֣חַֽ\rb* \rb the murderer|הָרֹצֵֽחַ׃\rb*\rb |ה֑וּא\rb* \rb must surely be put to death.|מ֥וֹת\rb*\rb |יוּמַ֖ת\rb*
\p \v 19 \rb The avenger|גֹּאֵ֣ל\rb* \rb of blood|הַדָּ֔ם\rb*\rb |ה֥וּא\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb is to put the murderer|הָרֹצֵ֑חַ\rb* \rb to death;|יָמִ֖ית\rb* \rb when he finds|בְּפִגְעוֹ־\rb* \rb him,|ב֖וֹ\rb* \rb he|ה֥וּא\rb* \rb is to kill him.|יְמִיתֶֽנּוּ׃\rb*
\p \v 20 \rb Likewise, if|וְאִם־\rb* \rb anyone maliciously|בְּשִׂנְאָ֖ה\rb* \rb pushes another|יֶהְדָּפֶ֑נּוּ\rb* \rb or|אֽוֹ־\rb* \rb intentionally|בִּצְדִיָּ֖ה\rb* \rb throws an object|הִשְׁלִ֥יךְ\rb* \rb at him|עָלָ֛יו\rb* \rb and kills him,|וַיָּמֹֽת׃\rb* \v 21 \rb or|א֣וֹ\rb* \rb if in hostility|בְאֵיבָ֞ה\rb* \rb he strikes him|הִכָּ֤הוּ\rb* \rb with his hand|בְיָדוֹ֙\rb* \rb and he dies,|וַיָּמֹ֔ת\rb* \rb the one who struck him|הַמַּכֶּ֖ה\rb* \rb must surely be put to death;|מֽוֹת־\rb*\rb |יוּמַ֥ת\rb* \rb he|ה֑וּא\rb* \rb is a murderer.|רֹצֵ֣חַֽ\rb* \rb When the avenger|גֹּאֵ֣ל\rb* \rb of blood|הַדָּ֗ם\rb* \rb finds|בְּפִגְעוֹ־\rb* \rb the murderer,|הָרֹצֵ֖חַ\rb* \rb he is to kill|יָמִ֛ית\rb* \rb him.|אֶת־\rb*
