\p \v 5 \rb So at|עַל־\rb* \rb the word|פִּ֥י\rb* \rb of the LORD,|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁה֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb commanded|וַיְצַ֤ו\rb* \rb the Israelites:|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹ֑ר\rb* \rb “The tribe|מַטֵּ֥ה\rb* \rb of the sons|בְנֵֽי־\rb* \rb of Joseph|יוֹסֵ֖ף\rb* \rb speaks|דֹּבְרִֽים׃\rb* \rb correctly.|כֵּ֛ן\rb* \v 6 \rb This|זֶ֣ה\rb*\rb |הַדָּבָ֞ר\rb* \rb is what|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֗ה\rb* \rb has commanded|צִוָּ֣ה\rb* \rb concerning the daughters|לִבְנ֤וֹת\rb* \rb of Zelophehad:|צְלָפְחָד֙\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹ֔ר\rb* \rb They may marry|תִּהְיֶ֣ינָה\rb*\rb |לְנָשִׁ֑ים\rb* \rb anyone they please,|לַטּ֥וֹב\rb*\rb |בְּעֵינֵיהֶ֖ם\rb* \rb provided|אַ֗ךְ\rb* \rb they marry|תִּהְיֶ֥ינָה\rb*\rb |לְנָשִֽׁים׃\rb* \rb within a clan|לְמִשְׁפַּ֛חַת\rb* \rb of the tribe|מַטֵּ֥ה\rb* \rb of their father.|אֲבִיהֶ֖ם\rb* \v 7 \rb No|וְלֹֽא־\rb* \rb inheritance|נַחֲלָה֙\rb* \rb in Israel|לִבְנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb may be transferred|תִסֹּ֤ב\rb* \rb from tribe|מִמַּטֶּ֖ה\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb tribe,|מַטֶּ֑ה\rb* \rb because|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb each|אִ֗ישׁ\rb*\rb |בְּנֵ֥י\rb* \rb of the Israelites|יִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃\rb* \rb is to retain|יִדְבְּק֖וּ\rb* \rb the inheritance|בְּנַחֲלַת֙\rb* \rb of the tribe|מַטֵּ֣ה\rb* \rb of his fathers.|אֲבֹתָ֔יו\rb* \v 8 \rb Every|וְכָל־\rb* \rb daughter|בַּ֞ת\rb* \rb who possesses|יֹרֶ֣שֶׁת\rb* \rb an inheritance|נַחֲלָ֗ה\rb*\rb |בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb from any Israelite|יִשְׂרָאֵל֒\rb*\rb |לְאֶחָ֗ד\rb* \rb tribe|מִמַּטּוֹת֮\rb* \rb must marry|תִּהְיֶ֣ה\rb*\rb |לְאִשָּׁ֑ה\rb* \rb within a clan|מִמִּשְׁפַּ֛חַת\rb* \rb of the tribe|מַטֵּ֥ה\rb* \rb of her father,|אָבִ֖יהָ\rb* \rb so that|לְמַ֗עַן\rb* \rb every|אִ֖ישׁ\rb* \rb Israelite|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb will possess|יִֽירְשׁוּ֙\rb* \rb the inheritance|נַחֲלַ֥ת\rb* \rb of his fathers.|אֲבֹתָֽיו׃\rb* \v 9 \rb No|וְלֹֽא־\rb* \rb inheritance|נַחֲלָ֛ה\rb* \rb may be transferred|תִסֹּ֧ב\rb* \rb from one tribe|מִמַּטֶּ֖ה\rb* \rb to|לְמַטֶּ֣ה\rb* \rb another,|אַחֵ֑ר\rb* \rb for|כִּי־\rb* \rb each|אִישׁ֙\rb* \rb tribe|מַטּ֖וֹת\rb*\rb |בְּנֵ֥י\rb* \rb of Israel|יִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃\rb* \rb must retain|יִדְבְּק֕וּ\rb* \rb its inheritance.”|בְּנַ֣חֲלָת֔וֹ\rb*
\p \v 10 \rb So the daughters|בְּנ֥וֹת\rb* \rb of Zelophehad|צְלָפְחָֽד׃\rb* \rb did|עָשׂ֖וּ\rb* \rb as|כַּאֲשֶׁ֛ר\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb had commanded|צִוָּ֥ה\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Moses.|מֹשֶׁ֑ה\rb*\rb |כֵּ֥ן\rb* \v 11 \rb |וַתִּהְיֶ֜ינָה\rb* \rb Mahlah,|מַחְלָ֣ה\rb* \rb Tirzah,|תִרְצָ֗ה\rb* \rb Hoglah,|וְחָגְלָ֧ה\rb* \rb Milcah,|וּמִלְכָּ֛ה\rb* \rb and Noah,|וְנֹעָ֖ה\rb* \rb the daughters|בְּנ֣וֹת\rb* \rb of Zelophehad,|צְלָפְחָ֑ד\rb* \rb were married|לְנָשִֽׁים׃\rb* \rb to cousins on their|לִבְנֵ֥י\rb* \rb father’s side.|דֹדֵיהֶ֖ן\rb* \v 12 \rb They married|הָי֣וּ\rb*\rb |לְנָשִׁ֑ים\rb* \rb within the clans|מִֽמִּשְׁפְּחֹ֛ת\rb* \rb of the descendants|בְּנֵֽי־\rb* \rb of Manasseh|מְנַשֶּׁ֥ה\rb* \rb son|בֶן־\rb* \rb of Joseph,|יוֹסֵ֖ף\rb* \rb and their inheritance|נַחֲלָתָ֔ן\rb* \rb remained|וַתְּהִי֙\rb* \rb within|עַל־\rb* \rb the tribe|מַטֵּ֖ה\rb* \rb of their father’s|אֲבִיהֶֽן׃\rb* \rb clan.|מִשְׁפַּ֥חַת\rb*
\p \v 13 \rb These|אֵ֣לֶּה\rb* \rb are the commandments|הַמִּצְוֺ֞ת\rb* \rb and ordinances|וְהַמִּשְׁפָּטִ֗ים\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֛ה\rb* \rb gave|צִוָּ֧ה\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb* \rb through|בְּיַד־\rb* \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb on the plains|בְּעַֽרְבֹ֣ת\rb* \rb of Moab|מוֹאָ֔ב\rb* \rb by|עַ֖ל\rb* \rb the Jordan|יַרְדֵּ֥ן\rb* \rb across from Jericho.|יְרֵחֽוֹ׃\rb*
